<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">2 Samuel</book>
  <para style="h">2 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Samuel</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Samuel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saul a si zaw, Amalek-te zo-in David a kilekia ciengin Ziklag ah David ni ni sung a taam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ni thum ni-in a puon ki-ehmal, a lutanga leivui baang mi khat Saul’ giephuol panin a tung hi. David kung a tun bepin ama lei-ah bawhsuhin zatahna a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David in ama kungah, “Nang hei pana hing pei na hiei?” a ci hi. Ama in, “Israel giephuol pana hing suohta ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David in ama kungah, “Bang thu a om ei? Ei gen vawi!” a ci hi. Ama in, “Gal phuol panin galkapte a taimang vua, hinanle galkap tampitah pua-in a si uhi; tuale Saul le a tapa Jonathan zong a si hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in ama kunga thu puoh tangvalpa kungah, “Saul le a tapa Jonathan a si lam bang na ci thei ahiei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama kunga thu puoh tangvalpa in, “ Gilboa Muol ah ka va om kha ta hi. Tuale sakol leengte le sakol siemte in ama a na neh laitahun tua munah Saul a teipi tungah na kingam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A nualam a en leh kei ei mu-in ei hlan hi. Keima in ka dawng a, ‘Tanah om ing siepa,’ ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuale ama in keima kungah, “Nang koi na hiei?” ei ci hi. Ke’n ka dawng a, ‘Amalek-te khat ka hi hi,’ ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in kei kungah, ‘Hing pei inlen ei that ta’n; azieh pen ka lel mama ta a, hizongle ka hing kenkon lai hi,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n a tungah dingin ama ka that hi. Azieh pen a pua zaw ciengin ama hing nawn sih va ci ka thei hi. A lu tunga om kumpi lukhu le a ban tunga om bantuom ladawhin tuate tam sunga ka pu kungah kang tut hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in a puonte la-in botkeh hi; tuale a ompi mi zosie in zong tua bangma-in a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Saul, a tapa Jonathan, Topa’ galkapte le Israel innsung mite namsau tawh a si ziehun da-in kapin nitah dongin an a tang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David in ama kunga thu puoh tangvalpa kungah, “Hei pana hing pei na hiei?” a ci hi. Ama in, “Kei Amalek-te pemta khat’ tapa ka hi hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />David in ama kungah, “ Topa’ sathau nu pa that dinga na khut na hlan mawngmawng na zau sih amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in tangvalte khat hlanin ama kungah, “Tanah hing pei inlen ama satlia in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama in a satsuh pai a, ama a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />David in ama kungah, “Na sisan na lutungah tu taheh; bangzieh ahei cile na kamham in nangma langkhatah teci pang a, ‘ Topa’ sathau nu pa ka that zo ta hi,’ na ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David in tami kaala tawh Saul le Jonathan kaa a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />(ama in Judah mite kungah tami “Thaltang La” a kihil nadingin thu pie hi; tuami la Jashar Laibu sungah kigiel hi. Ama in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel aw, na minthanna, na munsangte tungah kithat! Mi hatte bangci pua sieng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gath ah gen sinlen, Ashkelon gawl lamah zong gen sin; tua hile Philistia tanute kipah ding a, a tep kitanlo mite’ tanute lungdamin a kipah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />No Gilboa muolte aw, daitui hile, guotui hile, ga nei logamte hile, na tung vuah omsah da un! Azieh pen mihatpa’ lum bua zo a, Saul’ lum sathau kinu nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A kithat pa’ sisan panin, mi thahat pa’ thau panin, Jonathan’ thaltang kinuale loin, Saul’ namsau a guohkia sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Saul le Jonathan a kihe vua, a it huoi mama uhi! A si a hinun ama gel a kikhen vawt sih uhi; muvanlai sangin ama gel gangzaw a, humpi sangin zong ama gel hatzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />No Israel tanute aw, Saul ziehin kap un. Puonsan nel silin a nuom op ziuzieu, na puon tung vua kham kizepna suongte aw, ama ziehin kap un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Galphuol sungah, mi hatte bangci pua! Na muol sangte tungah Jonathan kithat-in lum ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nang ziehin ka lung a kham hi, sanggam Jonathan aw; nei itna a gol sengin, nei itna lamdang a, numei’ itna sangin lienzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi hatte bangci pua, galhiemte bangci siet!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam zaw ciengin David in Topa dong a, “Judah khuopite khat popo-ah ka peito diei mah?” a ci hi. Topa in ama kungah, “Peito in,” a ci hi. David in, “Koi penah ka peito diei?” a ci hi. Ama in, “Hebron ah,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n David in a zi tegel, Jezreel-a Ahinoam le Carmel-a Nabal’ zi meigongnu Abigail tawh khum munah a peito uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David in a zawpi mite, mi zosie a innkuonpi ciet tawh peitopi hi; tuale Hebron khuopite-ah amate a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin khum munah Judah mite pei-in Judah kumpi dingin David sathau a nu uhi. Amate in David kungah, “Saul a vuite pen Jabesh-gilead mite hi,” ci-in a gen ciengun
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David in Jabesh-gilead mite kungah kamtaite sawl a, “Na pu uh Saul tungah tam bang citahna lahin na vui ziehun Topa in thupha hing pie ta uheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu-in Topa in na tung vuah itna kip le thumanna hing lah taheh! Tam banga na gamtat ziehun note thaman kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin na khut khausah unlen hang un; azieh pen na pu uh Saul si zo a, Judah innkuon in amate tungah kumpi dingin kei sathau ei nu zo uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hizongle Saul’ galkapmangpa Ner’ tapa Abner in Mahanaim ah Saul’ tapa Ishbaal a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in Gilead, Ashur, Jezreel, Ephraim, Benjamin, le Israel zosie tungah kumpi dingin ama a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel uh dinga ama a kipatin Saul’ tapa Ishbaal kum sawmli pha a, ama in kum ni sung uh hi. Ahi vangin Judah innkuon in David’ nua zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hebron-a Judah innkuon tungah David kumpi a suo hun sung pen kum sagi le hla guh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mahanaim pan Gibeon zuonin Ner’ tapa Abner le Saul’ tapa Ishbaal’ nasemte a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zeruiah’ tapa Joab le David’ nasemte peikhie-in Gibeon buolah amate a na dawn uhi. Pawlkhat buol langkhatah a to laitahun adang khat a buol langkhatah a to uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Abner in Joab kungah, “Tangvalte a mai-ah peisah vai-in i mai vuah kisuolsah vai,” a ci hi. Joab in, “Amate a mai-ah hing peisah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate a mai-ah pei-in a galkai kawmun Benjamin le Saul’ tapa Ishbaal adingin sawm le ni, le David’ nasemte adingin sawm le ni a kise uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in a kisihpi ciet uh a lutangah manin a namsau tawh a langpa a dawt ciet uhi; tuaci’n amate a puaton ciet uhi. Tua ziehin Gibeon-a khum mun pen Helkath-hazzurim kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khum ni-in gal kidona a nasie mama hi; tuale David’ nasemte in Abner le Israel mite a zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zeruiah’ tapa thumte, Joab, Abishai, le Asahel, khumnah a om uhi. Tu-in Asahel pen sakhi lee bangin a keng a mallang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asahel in Abner nuadel a, ama a del kawmin zietlam ah hile veilam ah hile a piel sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Abner in a nua enin, “Nang, Asahel na hi amah?” a ci hi. Ama in dawng a, “Ingheh, keima ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Abner in ama kungah, “Na ziet na vei kihei inlen, tangvalte khat penpen manin a van khat kilah in,” a ci hi. Ahi vangin ama a nuadelna panin Asahel a kinua hei tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Abner in Asahel kungah, “Kei ei del nawn sinlen piel ta’n; bang dingin ke’n nang tuolah hing satlia ta lawm ding ka hei? Tua bang bawl mawh leng na sanggampa Joab kungah bangci bangin ka maitang laa nawn ding ka hei?” a ci leuleu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama a kinua hei nuom tuon sih hi. Tuaci’n Abner in teipi dawn tawh a gilpi khaw a, tuaci’n a teipi in pailetin a el lamah a pusuoh hi. Khum munah ama puasuhin a puana munah a si hi. Tuale Asahel pua-in a sina munah a pei mi zosie pia loin a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanle Joab le Abishai in Abner a nuadel vua, nitum laitahin ama gel Gibeon gamlah peina lampi tunga om Giah mai-a kihlung Ammah muol a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Benjamin-te, Abner kimah kikhawmin pawlkhat a suoh uhi; amate muol dawn khatah a pang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin Abner in Joab hlan a, “Namsau in mi a nawmval den ding ma amah? A tawpna ah hamsa zaw ding hi, ci thei lo na hi amah? A sanggamte a nuadelna panin a kihei nadingun na mite thu na pieh ding bang tanvei sawt lai ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Joab in, “Pasien a hin ma bangin hing genkha sih lacin, mite in a sanggamte uh zingmawng cieng dong khawl vawt loin a del peisuoh ding uh ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Joab in zong pengkul mutin tuale mi zosie a khawl uhi; amate in zong Israel-te nuadel nawn loin gal zong a do nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Abner le a mite in khum zan tungtawnin Arabah lam tawnin khuol a zin uhi; amate in Jordan a kantan vua, tuale sunlai masang zingmawng tungtawnin pei-in Mahanaim ah a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Abner a nuadelna panin Joab a kilekia a, ama in mi zosie a kaikhop zaw ciengin Asahel simlo David’ nasemte mi sawmkuo le kuo a pelem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahi vangin David’ nasemte in Abner’ mite ahi Benjamin-te zathum le sawmguh a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amate in Asahel luong a puo vua, tuaci’n Bethlehem-a om a pa hanah a vui uhi. Joab le a mite zan tungtawn pei-in Hebron ah khuo a vah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saul’ innkuon le David’ innkuonte kikalah sau veipi kidona om hi; David thahat semsem a, Saul thanem semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David in Hebron-ah tapate nei hi: A tapa tapen Jezreel-a Ahinoam tawh a nei Amnon ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a tapa nina pen Carmel-a Nabal’ zi Abigail tawh a nei Chileab ahi hi; a tapa thumna pen Geshur Kumpipa Talmai’ tanu Maacah tawh a nei Absalom ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a tapa lina pen Haggith’ tapa Adonijah ahi hi; a tapa ngana pen Abital’ tapa Shephatiah ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a tapa guhna pen David’ zi Eglah tawh a nei Ithream ahi hi. Tam teng pen Hebron-a David pana a piengte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saul’ innkuonte le David’ innkuonte kikalah kidona a om sungin Saul’ innkuon sungah Abner a thahat semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu-in Saul in Aiah’ tanu Rizpah min nei khat mei-in sie hi. Tuale Ishbaal in Abner kungah, “Bang dinga ka pa’ meinu na luppi ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ishbaal’ thugente ziehin Abner lungthah mama hi; ama in, “Kei Judah dinga ui lutang bang lel ka mah? Keima in na pa Saul’ innkuonte, a sanggamte, le a guolte tungah tuni dong citahna ka lah den ziehin David’ khut sungah note kang pieh nai lo ahi bo a, ahi vangin nang in tu-in tami numei tawh kisai-in nei mawmat hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Saul’ innkuon panin kumpi gam khinin Dan panin Beer-sheba cieng dong Israel le Judah tungah David’ kumpi topha phut dingin David tungah Topa in a na ciemsa thu ama adingin ka tunsah sih tah ma leh Pasien in keima Abner ei dawm sih taheh!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ishbaal in kam khat zong Abner dawng ngam lo hi, azieh pen ama a giing mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Abner in Hebron -a om David kungah kamtai sawlin ama kungah, “Tam gam koi uh ding ahei?” a ci hi. Kei tawh thuciemna hing bawl in. Israel zosie nang lamah ang pei nadingin keima’n nang kang panpi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in, “Hoi hi; nang tawh thuciemna khat ka bawl ding hi. Ahi vangin na kungah kang nget nop khat a om hi; kei tawh kimu dinga nang pei ciengin Saul’ tanu Michal nang zawpi sih leh ka mai na mu sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in Saul’ tapa Ishbaal kungah kamtaite sawl a, “Philistia-te vuntep zakhat tawh ka leisa ka zi Michal ei pie in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ishbaal in mi sawlin a pasal Laish’ tapa Paltiel kung pan tua nu a lasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin a pasal in ama zui a, Bahurim peina lam tungtawn a nua-ah a kaa kawmin a zui hi. Tua ciengin Abner in ama kungah, “Inn lamah kilekia ta’n!” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama a kilekia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abner in Israel upate kam vaihlah a, “A tawpsa hun khat lai-in David na kumpi dingun na sui kawikawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu-in tahsuosah un; azieh pen Topa in David kungah kamciem zo hi: Ka nasempa David tungtawnin Philistia-te le a galte zosie’ khut sung panin ka mi Israel ka hunkhie ding hi,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Abner in zong Benjamin-te tungah a gen hi; tua ciengin Israel zosie le Benjamin innkuon zosie in zong tua bang bawl dingin a baisa-in a om uhi, ci thu Hebron-a David kungah a gen dingin Abner a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hebron-a David kungah mi sawmni tawh Abner a pei ciengin, David in Abner le a zawpi mite adingin pawi khat a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Abner in David kungah, “Amate in nangma tawh thuciemna a bawl thei nading ule na lungsim sunga om bangin amate zosie tungah na uh thei nadingin, kei va pei-in ka pu kumpipa kungah Israel zosie ka va kaikhawm ta ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua zaw lientahin a galsimna panun Joab tawh David’ nasemte tungin na tampi a tut uhi. Ahi vangin Hebron-a David kungah Abner na om lo hi; azieh pen David in ama a na sawldawh ta a, ama lungmuongin a na pei ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Joab le a zawpi galkap zosie a tun ciengun Joab kungah, “Kumpipa kungah Ner’ tapa Abner pei a, ama lungmuongin peikia zo hi,” ci-in kigen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joab pei-in kumpipa kungah, “Bang bawl na hi ahei? Na kungah Abner ang haw hi; a suotah thei nadinga bang dinga ama na sawldawh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nang ang sol ding, na sungtum na pusuo ang thei ding, le nasepna zosie ang kan dinga Ner’ tapa Abner na kunga ang haw ahi lam na thei gegu ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />David kung panin Joab a pei zaw ciengin ama in Abner kungah kamtaite sawl a, amate in Sirah Tuikhuh panin ama a nua zawpikia uhi; ahi vangin David in tua thu thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hebron ah Abner a kilekia ciengin Joab in kituom hopi dingin tunkot phung lamah ama zawpi a, tuale ama in a gil a sutpieh hi. Tuaci’n Joab’ sanggampa Asahel’ sisan luonna ziehin ama a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin, David in tua thu a zah ciengin ama in, “Ner’ tapa Abner’ sisan ziehin Topa mai-ah keima le ka kumpigam a tawntungin maw ka baang sih uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Joab lutung le a pa’ innkuonte zosie tungah tami khielna tu taheh; tuale Joab’ innkuon tawh nin pei mi hile, a phah mi hile, ciengkhut khun mi hile, namsau tawh a kithat mi hile, anneh ding nei lo mi tawh hile kilawi ngai sih taheh!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in Gibeon-a galkidona-ah a sanggampa uh Asahel a thapieh ziehin Joab le a sanggampa Abishai in Abner a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in Joab le a optonpi mi zosie kungah, “Na puonsilte uh botkehin la-ip puon sil unlen Abner adingin kap un,” a ci hi. Tuale kumpipa David in mi siluong a zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amate in Hebron ah Abner a vui uhi. Abner’ hanah kumpipa a gingin kap a, mi zosie zong a kap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Abner adingin kumpipa in kaateng a lo a, Abner, mimaw khat’ si banga mawh si ding na ta amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na khutte kikan lo a, na kengte kol kibul lo hi; mi gilote mai-a puate bangin nang zong na pua ta hi,” a ci hi. Tuale ama ziehin mi zosie a kap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ciengin ni a op sungin an ne dingin David a zawl uhi; ahi vangin David kiciemin, “Ni tum masangin an hile, na khat popo hile ka tep leh Pasien in keima ei dawm sih taheh!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mi zosie in tua thu a phawh vua, tua in amate a lungdamsah hi; kumpipa’ sep zosie in zong mi zosie a lungkimsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuaci’n mi zosie le Israel zosie in Ner’ tapa Abner kithana thu-ah kumpipa kikum kha lo hi, ci thu khum ni-in a thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuale kumpipa in a nasemte kungah, “Israel sungah ulien le mi thupi khat si zo hi, ci thu note in na thei nai sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Sathau kinu kumpi ka hi vangin tuni-in kei ka tha zawngkhal mama hi. Zeruiah’ ta tam mite khu kei adingin a thuohha mama hi. Gitlo a bawlpa a gitlona bangin Topa in thuhkia taheh!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hebron-ah Abner si zo ci thu Saul’ tapa Ishbaal in a zah ciengin a thakiem a, Israel zosie lungkie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul’ tapa in galsim pawlte makai mi ni nei hi; khat pa’ min Baanah hi a, adang khat pa’ min Rechab ahi hi. Ama gel pen Beeroth pan Benjamin mi Rimmon’ tapate ahi uhi, azieh pen Beeroth khu Benjamin-a’ in kisim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />(Gittaim-ah Beeroth mite a tai vua, tuni dongin khum tahah pemta-in a om uhi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Saul’ tapa Jonathan in tapa khelbai khat nei hi. Jezreel panin Saul le Jonathan’ si a kizahin ama kum nga a pha hi. A naucing nu in ama la-in a taipi hi; tuale ama nu a nawtai na lamin naupangno khiehsuo-in a khel a bai hi. Ama’ min Mephibosheth ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu-in Beeroth mi Rimmon’ tapate Rechab le Baanah a kuon vua, sun nisat hun pawl, Ishbaal’ inn ah a sunkim tawlngah hun laitahin a tung gel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama gel zong mangbu la ding a kipang vua, inn sungah lutin a gilpi a sutkehpieh vua, tua ciengin Rechab le a sanggampa Baanah a suohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu-in ama’ lupna khan sunga a lupna tungah a lup laitahin inn sungah ama gel a lut uhi; ama gel in ama simin a that vua, a lu a tan uhi. Tua ciengin a lutang la-in Arabah lampi zui-in zan tawn tungin a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hebron-a om David kungah ama gel in Ishbaal’ lutang a tut vua, tuale kumpipa kungah, “Tha dinga ang sui na gal Saul’ tapa Ishbaal’ lutang tam sungah om hi; Topa in tuni-in Saul le a suonlehlahte tungah ka pu kumpipa’ phu la zo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />David in zong Beeroth-te Rimmon’ tapa gel ahi Rechab le a sanggampa Baanah dawngin, “Hahsatna zosie panin keima’ hinna ei hunkhie Topa a hing ahi ma bangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />mi khat in ka kungah, ‘En in, Saul si ta,’ ci-a ang gen ciengin ama thuhoi puohin a kingaituo a, ken lah ama manin Ziklag-ah ka that hi; tam pen keima in ama’ thupuoh zieha ka pieh thaman ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahile ama’ inn sung, ama’ lupna tungah mi dihpa khat a that migilopa tungah bang za-in sietna kibawl zaw kan lai ding ahei! Tu-in na khut sung vuah ama’ sisan hing ngenin leitung panin kang susie sih ding uh amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n David in tangvalte thu pie a, ama gel a that uhi; ama gel in a khut a keng tegel sattanin Hebron-a buol gei-ah a luonghawm a khai uhi. Hinanle Ishbaal’ lutang la-in Hebron-a Abner’ hanah a vui uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Hebron-a David kungah Israel minamte zosie pei-in, “En in, kote nangma’ gu le nangma’ tel le vo ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hun khat lai, kote tungah Saul kumpi ahi lai-in, Israel a peipi le a tunpi pa khu nangma na hi hi. Topa in na kungah tam bangin a gen hi: Ka mi Israel a cing ding pa na hi a, Israel tungah a uhpa ding na hi hi,” ei ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n Hebron-a kumpipa kungah Israel upa zosie a pei uhi; tuale Kumpi David in Topa mai Hebron ah amate tawh thuciemna khat bawlin Israel tungah kumpi dingin David sathau a nu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpi a sep kipatin David kum sawmthum pha a, kum sawmli sung uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in Hebron ah Judah gam kum sagi le hla guh sung uh hi; tuale ama in Jerusalem ah kum sawmthum le thum sung Israel zosie le Judah uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa le a mite khum gama teng Jebus-te sim dingin Jerusalem-ah a pei vua, amate in David kungah, “Tam sungah nang lut zo vet sih ding hi. Mittaw le khelbaite na ngawnin ang notmang zo ding uhi,” a ci hi. “Tam sungah David ang lut zo sih ding hi,” ci-in ngaisun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin David in tu-a David khuopi ahi Zion mun muonhuoi a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khum ni-in David in, “Jebus-te a vatgawp nuom poma in David in a muda mite ahi mittawte le khelbaite sim dingin tuizawl dungah pei taheh,” a ci hi. Tua ahi ziehin Topa’ inn sungah mittawte le khelbaite lut lo ding hi,” kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />David in mun muonhuoi a la a, David khuopi ci-in a min phuo hi. David in khuopi kimkotin Millo sunglam zosie panin khuopi a lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vanglien Pasien, Topa tawh a opton ziehin David a vanglien semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tyre kumpipa Hiram in David kungah kamtaite le tuum singte, le David’ inn a lampieh khutsiemte, le leiseh siemte zong a puoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel tungah ama kumpi-in Topa in a kipsah zona le ama’ mi Israel ziehin ama’ kumpi gam a tawisang lam David in a theicien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hebron panin a tun zaw ciengin David in Jerusalem panin zineute le zite lahbe lai hi; tuale David in tanu le tapate a neibe lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jerusalem-a pieng David’ tate min: Shammua, Shobab, Nathan, Solomon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ibhar, Elishua, Nepheg, Japhia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Elishama, Eliada, le Eliphelet ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpi-in Israel tungah David sathau a kinu zo lam Philistia-te in a zah ciengun David sui dingin Philistia-te zosie a kuonto uhi; hizongle David in tua thu na za-in munmuonhuoi-ah na peisuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu-in Rephaim kuomah Philistia-te pei-in a kithezah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />David in Topa dong a, “Philistia-te sim dingin ka kuonto diei mah? Ka khut sungah amate nei pie diei mah?” a ci hi. Topa in David kungah, “Kuonto in. Azieh pen keima in na khut sungah Philistia-te kang pie tahtah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n Baal-perazim ah David pei a, khum munah David in amate a zogawp hi. Ama in, “Tuikhang in a phulmang bangin Topa in ka mai-ah ka galte phulmang zo hi,” a ci hi. Tua ziehin khum mun Baal-perazim ci-in a min kiphuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Philistia-te in khum munah a milimte uh a nuasie vua, David le a mite in tuate a puomang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Philistia-te a kuonto kia vua, Rephaim kuomah a kithezahkia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />David in Topa thu a dawh ciengin ama in, “Na kuonto sih ding hi; amau’ nua lamah kuol pei inlen lungli singte galkhat panin amate del in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lungli singte tung panin galte’ ketot gin na zah ciengin kigingsa-in om in; azieh pen Philistia-te a vatmai dingin na mai-ah Topa a pei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa’ thupieh bangin David gamta hi; tuale ama in Geba panin Geza dongin Philistia-te a vatmai hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David in Israel-te a kiteelkhie mi tul sawmthum khawmkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khum mun panin Cherub-te tunga om, Vanglien Topa’ min tawh a kilo Pasien’ singkuong a zawng dingin a optonpi mi zosie tawh Baale-judah ah David a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Leeng tha tungah Pasien’ Singkuong a puo vua, muol tunga om Abinadab’ inn panin a peipi uhi. Abinadab’ tapate Uzzah le Ahio in leeng tha khat tawh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasien’ singkuong a hawi uhi; tuale singkuong mai-ah Ahio a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David le Israel’ innkuon zosie in a tha nei za-un, Topa mai-ah late, lyre lasahnate, harp lasahnate, tawmte, kuongtuote, le daltuote tumin a lam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nacon’ ancilna phuol a tun ciengun bawngtangte in leeng a lawthing ziehin Uzzah in Pasien’ singkuong a khut tawh zamin tu kha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Uzzah tungah Topa’ lungthahna a tung hi; tuale ama in a khut tawh singkuong a zap ziehin Pasien in khum munah ama a vatlum hi; tuale Pasien’ singkuong gei-ah ama a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pasien in Uzzah a tha ziehin David lungthah mama hi; tuaci’n tuni dongin khum mun pen Perez-uzza ci-in a min kiphuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khum ni-in David in Topa a giing hi; ama in, “Keima’ kep dingin “ Topa’ singkuong bang hing ci tun thei ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n David khuopi sunga ama’ kep dingin Topa’ singkuong a kitut ding David nuom lo hi; tua sung tangin David in Gitt mi Obed-edom’ inn ah a tut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gitt mi Obed-edom’ inn ah Topa’ singkuong hla thum sung a thaam hi; tuale Topa in Obed-edom le a innkuonpi zosie thupha a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kumpi David kungah, “Pasien’ singkuong ziehin Topa in Obed-edom innkuon le ama’ nei zosie thupha pie hi,” ci-in kigen hi. Tuaci’n David pei-in Obed-edom’ inn panin David khuopi sungah kipahtahin Pasien’ singkuong a peipi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tuale Topa’ singkuong a puote in kal guh a suon zaw ciengun ama in bawngtang khat le bawngno thau khat biehpiehna-in a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa mai-ah a tha nei za-in David lam hi; David in saihadiel siempupuon khat sil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n David le Israel mi zosie in kikona le pengkul tumna tawh Topa’ singkuong a peipito uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />David khuopi sungah Topa’ singkuong a tun lai tahin tawlet panin Saul’ tanu Michal khuodah a, tuale ama in Topa mai-ah David Kumpipa lamin a dieng vazawh a mu hi; tuale ama nu in a lungsim sungah a simmaw dap mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in Topa’ singkuong a lutpi vua, tuale David in ama dinga a na lamsa ahi puonbuh sung ama mun dingah koi hi; tuale Topa mai-ah David in meihal biehnate le thunuom biehnate a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />David in meihal biehnate le thunuom biehnate a pieh zaw ciengin Vanglien Topa’ minin mite thupha pie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />mite zosie lahah Israel mihon buppi, numei le pasalte moh pheng khat, saba khat , le lenggagaw pheng khat ciet a pie hi. Tua ciengin mi zosie a inn ciet vuah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A innkuonte thupha pie dingin David a peikia hi. Hinanle David dawn dingin Saul’ tanu Michal pei a, tuale ama in, “Mi kheltat khatpo in zumzie thei loin a guohtanga a op bangin, a nasem numeite muna-ah tuni-in a guohtanga a om Israel kumpipa khu ama le ama bangci kipatawi a ta diei!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />David in Michal kungah, “ Topa’ mi Israel tungah ulien dinga ei koi dingin na pa le a innkuonte zosie tanga kei ei teel Topa mai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tam sangin a simmawhuoi zaw-in kei le kei ka kibawl lai ding a, keima’ mitmu mama-in a ginalo ka hi ding hi; hinanle nangma’ gen numeite in kei ei zatah mama ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Saul’ tanu Michal a si dongin ta nei thei nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in a inn ah kumpipa teng a, Topa in a kimvela a galte zosie panin ama tawlngahna a pieh zaw ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />kumpipa in kamsang Nathan kungah, “Tu-in en in, kei taamtah sing inn ah ka teng a, ahi vangin Pasien’ singkuong puonbuh sungah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nathan in kumpipa kungah, “Pei inlen, na lungsim sunga om zosie bawl in; bang ding ahei cile Topa in nang ang ompi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanle tua zan ma-in Nathan kungah tam bangin Topa’ thu a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang va pei-in ka nasempa David kungah tam bangin va gen ta’n: Topa in tam bangin a ci hi: Ten na ding inn khat ei lampieh ding na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Egypt panin Israel mite ka peipito ni-a kipan tuni dongin inn sungah ka teng nai sih a, puonbuh le biehbuh sungah ka vah kawikawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel mi zosiete lahah ka vana mun zosie-ah keima in ka mi Israel a cing dinga ka thupieh Israel minam makai khatpo tungah, “Bang dingin kei adingin taamtah sing inn khat beh ei lampieh lo na hei?” ci-in kam khat beh ka gen ngai amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in ka nasempa David kungah tam bangin na gen ding hi: Vanglien Topa in tam bangin gen hi: Lodawnna mun, tuute na zuina panin ka mi Israel tungah ulien dingin kang la hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tuale na peina popo-ah hing ompi-in na mai panin na galte zosie kang hepkhietpieh hi; tuale keima in leitunga miliente’ min bang ma-in nang adingin min lien khat kang bawlpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima in ka mi Israel adingin mun khat se-in amate ka tu ding hi, tuaci’n a mun ciet vuah a ten thei nadingun amate kisubuoi nawn lo ding hi; tuale nidang lai bangin migilote in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ka mi Israel tungah thukhen mangte ka koi huna kipanin amate gimsah nawn lo ding hi; tuale na gal zosie panin tawldamna nang kang pie ding hi. Tua tham loin na tungah Topa in suonlehlah ang pieh ding thu Topa in ang gen zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na hinna nite tawpin na pu na pate tawh na lupton ciengin, nangma sung pana ang suoh ding na cihlahte nangma nua-ah ka khangsah ding a, ama’ kumpi gam ka phut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in ka min dingin inn khat lam ding a, keima in a kumpi gam’ topha a tawntungin ka kipsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima ama’ pa ka hi ding a, ama keima’ tapa hi ding hi. Ama in khielna a bawl ciengin mite zah ciengduoi tawh ama dan ka pie ding a, mihingte tung panin gimna ka thuohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanle keima in na mai pana ka delmang Saul tung panin ka itna kip ka lahdawh bangin ama kung panin ka ladawh sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka mai-ah na suon na hlahte le na kumpi gam a kip zing dingin kibawl ding a, na kumpi topha kumtawnin kip ding hi,’ ci-in gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nathan in tam thu zosie le tam mangmuna zosie tawh kituohin David kungah a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpi David sungtumin Topa mai-ah to a, “ Topa Pasien aw, tu cieng dong tam banga nei kep nei hui nadingin kei koi ka hi a, ka innkuon bang ahi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua banah Topa Pasien aw, tami khu nangma’ mai-ah thu neuno khat hi lai hi; nang in sauveipi cienga ang tung ding na nasempa’ innkuonte thu zong na gen zo ta hi. Tami khu mite adingin thuhilna hing hisah ta’n, Topa Pasien aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />David in nang tungah bang ang gen be thei na diei? Bangzieh ahei cile nangma in na nasempa na thei siem hi, Topa Pasien aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na thuciemna bang le na lungsim tawh kizui-in na nasempa in a thei nadingin tam thulien zosie na bawl zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien aw, ka bil vua ka zahsa zosie uh bangin nang na lien hi; azieh pen nang bang koima om lo a, nang simlo Pasien dang om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel tawh a kibang nangma’ mi khu koi ahiei? Ama’ mite mai-ah minamte le a pasien-te uh a delgamna tawh ama dingin min bawlin amate dingin a lien a zauhuoi nate bawlpieh a, Pasien pei-in ama’ mi dinga a tatkhiet vawt adang minam leitungah a om ngai ta mawng amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa aw, nangma’ mi suoh zing dingin na mi Israel na sudet zo hi; tuale a, Topa aw, nang amau’ Pasien na suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuale Topa Pasien aw, tu-in na nasempa le a suonlehlahte tawh kisai-in a tawntungin na gensa thu kipsah in; na kamciemsa bangin bawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua hile ‘Vanglien Topa khu Israel tunga Pasien ahi hi,’ ci-in na min ang kiliensah zing ding hi; tuale na mai-ah na nasempa David’ innkuonte kumpi-in kikipsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile Israel’ Pasien, Vanglien Topa aw, ‘Nang adingin innkuon khat kang pie ding hi,’ ci-in na nasempa tungah tam thu nei hilsa ahi hi. Tua ahi zieha na nasempa in na kungah tam thungetna kang nget ngam ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tu-in Topa Pasien aw, nang Pasien na hi a, na thugente man a, na nasempa tungah tami sil hoi na kamciem zo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />tua ahi ziehin tu-in na mai-a a om zing thei nadingin na nasempa’ innkuonte thupha na pieh ding lungkim in; bangzieh ahei cile Topa Pasien aw, nang in na gen zo a, na thupha tawh na nasempa’ innkuon thupha kipie zing ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zaw hun khat ciengin David in Philistia-te simin a zo hi; David in Philistia-te’ khut sung panin Metheg-ammah a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in Moab-te zong zo-in tuolah lumsah a, khauzam khat tawh amate a te hi; ama in tha dingin guol ni le hinkhawi dingin guol khat dim a te hi. Moab-te ahile David’ nasemte suohin sieh le kaihte a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A uhna gam ngakia nuomin Euphrates lui-ah Zobah kumpipa Rehob’ tapa Hadadezer a pei laitahin David in ama a vatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David in sakol galkap tulkhat le zasagi le lei galkap tul sawmni man hi. David in leengkai sakol zosie a kapzahui vatsan a, hinanle leeng zakhat adingin a kicing a hen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Damascus gama Aram-te, Zobah kumpipa Hadadezer a panpi dingin a kuon ciengun David in Aram-te tul sawmni le tulni that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in Damascus gama Aram-te lahah khuocingte koi hi; tuale Aram-te pen David’ nasemte a suoh vua, sieh le kaih a pie uhi. Topa in a peina popo-ah David guolzawna a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />David in Hadadezer’ nasemte in a puoh uh kham tawh kibawl lumte a lahpieh a, Jerusalem-ah tuate a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David Kumpipa in Hadadezer’ khuopite Betah le Berothai panin sumngo tampi a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />David in Hadadezer’ galkap zosie a zawna thu Hamath kumpipa Toi in a zah ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ama in Hadadezar do-in a zawna hangin ama a hopi ding le a noppi dingin Toi in Kumpi David kungah a tapa Joram a sawl hi. Hadadezer pen Toi tawh galin a kido ngai zel hi. Joram in ngun, kham, le sumngo tawh kibawl nate a puoh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />David in a zawsa minam zosiete panin a ap ngun le khamte tawh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Edom, Moab, Ammon-te, Philistia-te, le Zobah kumpipa Rehob’ tapa Hadadezer in a nuasie van teng zong Topa tungah ap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David in ama’ minthan nadingin a bawl hi. A kinuale lamin ama in Ci Kuom ah Edom-te tul sawm le tulgiet that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in Edom ah khuocingte a koi hi; ama in Edom gam mun zosie-ah khuocingte koi a, tuale Edom-te zosie David’ nasemte a suoh uhi. Tuale a peina popo-ah Topa in David guolzawna a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel gam sungah David a maang hi; tuale David in a mi zosie tungah thutang le thuman zang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Zeruiah’ tapa Joab in galkapte uh hi; Ahilud’ tapa Jehoshaphat pen thuciemte pa ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahitub’ tapa Zadok le Abiathar’ tapa pen Ahimelech siempu ahi uhi; Seraiah pen thuvanpi pa ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jehoiada’ tapa Benaiah in Chereth-te le Peleth-te tungah uh a, David’ tapate siempu ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David in, “Jonathan ziehin ama tungah ka migitna ka lah thei nadingin Saul’ innkuon sungah mi khatpo a om lai ei mah’” ci-in dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul’ innkuon sungah a min Ziba a kici nasempa khat om a, ama David kungah a hlan uhi. Kumpipa in ama kungah, “Nang Ziba na mah?” a ci leh ama in, “Na nasempa hi na’ng!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Pasien’ migitna ama tungah ka lah thei nadingin Saul’ innkuon sungah mi khat beh a om lai diei mah?” a ci hi. Ziba in kumpipa kungah, “Jonathan’ tapa khat omlai hi; ama pen a khelbai ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Ama hei-a om ahiei?” a ci hi. Ziba in kumpipa kungah, “Lodebar-a Ammiel’ tapa Machir’ inn ah om hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Kumpi David in mi sawlin Lodebar-a Ammiel’ tapa Machir’ inn panin ama a lasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David kungah Saul’ tapa Jonathan, a tapa Mephibosheth a pei a, tuale a mai tuol kunin zatahna a pie hi. David in, “Mephibosheth!” a ci hi. Ama in dawng a, “Na nasempa ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />David in ama kungah, “Zau sin, azieh pen na pa Jonathan ziehin na tungah migitna kang lah ding hi; keima in na pu Saul’ leitang zosie nang tungah kang piekia ding a, ka sabuoi-ah an na ne zing ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in zatahna pie-in, “Ui sisa khat bang lel kei nei hici bawl nadingin na nasempa bang hi mawh ka hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in Saul’ nasempa Ziba hlanin ama kungah, “Saul le a innkuon sung mite’ neisa zosie na pu’ tupa kungah ka pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangma le na tapate le na nasemte in ama adingin lo na hlo ding vua, na pu’ tupa in anneh ding a nei nadingin lo-a piengte na puoh ding uhi; hizongle na pu’ tupa Mephibosheth in ka sabuoi ah an a ne zing ding hi,” a ci hi. Tua hun laitahin Ziba in tapa sawm le nga le nasem sawmni nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Ziba in kumpipa kungah, “Ka pu kumpipa in a nasempa nei thupieh zosie bangin na nasempa in a sem ding hi,” a ci hi. Mephibosheth in kumpipa’ tapate khat bangin David’ sabuoi-ah an a ne hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mephibosheth in a min Mica a kici tapa tangval khat nei hi. Tuale Ziba’ inn-a a teng zosie zong Mephibosheth’ nasemte a suoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in kumpipa’ sabuoi-ah an a neh zing ziehin Jerusalem ah Mephibosheth a teng hi. Tu-in ama pen a khel a langni-a bai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zaw hun khat ciengin Ammon-te’ kumpipa si-in a tapa Hanun in ama’ za luo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David in, “Keima tungah a pa ang thuman gamtat bangin Nahash’ tapa Hanun tungah zong thumanin ka gamta ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n a pa tawh kisai-in ama henem dingin David in palaite a sawl hi. Ammon-te’ gam sungah David’ palaite a tun ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ammon-te’ makaite in Hanun kungah, “Nang ang henem dingin ama in a kamtaite ang sawl ziehin David in na pa patawi hi, ci-in na ngaisun tahtah amah? David in khuo sung a en ding, thu kandap ding, le a thalpai dinga a mite ang sawldap hi lo amah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n Hanun in David’ palaite manin a khamul uh alang ciet heukieupieh a, a puonsilte uh a laikim, a pheizum huop zo maimai-in tansanpiehin amate a sawlmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />David kungah tua thu a kigen ciengin amate dawn dingin mi a sawl hi; bangzieh ahei cile amate nahpitahin a maizum uhi. Kumpipa in, “Na khamul uh a saukia masangsie Jericho ah hing om tadi unlen, tua ciengin hing peikia un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ammon-te in David’ huot mi a suo zo lam uh a kithei bepun, Ammon-te in mi sawlin Beth-rehob le Zobah-a Aram-te lei galkap tul sawmni le kumpi Maacah mi tulkhat tawh, Tob mite tul sawm le tulni a ciel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />David in tua thu a zah ciengin Joab le galkap galhang zosie a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ammon-te a kuon vua, galsim dingin tunkot lutna-ah panmun a la uhi; ahi vangin Zobah le Rehob-a Aram-te, Tob-te, le Maacah-te, gam sungah a tuom om ciet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Joab in a nua le ama-ah ama sim dingin galte a pan lam a mu ciengin Israel mi pawlkhat tuomteelin Aram-te sim dingin a pangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in Ama’ mi a omlai teng a sanggampa Abishai’ uhna sungah koi a, Ammon-te do dingin a pangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in, “Kei dingin Aram-te a thahat seng uleh kei nei hu ding hi; hizongle nang dingin Aram-te a thahat seng uleh kei hing pei-in nang kang hu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kihatsah inlen, i mipite ading le i Pasien’ khuopite adingin hangsan vai; tuale ama’ hoisah bangin Topa in hing bawl taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n Joab le ama tawh a pangton mite in Aram-te tawh kido dingin a kuon uhi; tuale ama mai-ah amate a taimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ammon-te in Aram-te a taimang uh a mu ciengun amate zong Abishai’ mai-ah a tai vua, khuopi sungah a lut uhi. Tua ciengin Ammon-te tawh a kidona panun Joab kilekia a, Jerusalem ah a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin Israel-te in amate a zaw lam Aram-te in a thei ciengun a kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hadadezer in mi sawlin Euphrates galkhata Aram-te a hlansah hi; tuale a makai uh ahi Hadadezer’ galkapmangpa Shobach tawh Helem ah amate a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David kungah tam thu a kigen ciengin ama in Israel zosie khawm a, Jordan galkai-in Helem ah a tung uhi. David sim dingin Aram-te na pangin ama tawh a kido uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel mai-ah Aram-te a tai uhi; tuale David in leeng zasagi a hawi Aram-te, le sakol tung tuong mi tul sawmli that a, a galkapmangpa uh Shobach a liemsah hi, tuaci’n khum munah ama a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel-te in a zawna thu Hadedazer’ nasem kumpi zosie in a thei ciengun, Israel-te tawh kilemna a bawl vua, a khut nei vuah a om uhi. Tuaci’n Aram-te in Ammon-te a panpi ngam nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Galsim dingin kumpite a kuonkia hun uh khuokhal lai-in David in Joab, le a optonpi a uliente, le Israel zosie a sawl hi; amate in Ammon-te a sugawp vua, Rabbah a kui-im uhi. Ahi vangin Jerusalem-ah David a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khatvei nitah kai lamin a lupna panin David tho a, kumpi inn khumvum tungah a vah kawikawi ciengin inn khumvum panin a kipumsil numei khat galmu kha hi; tua numei nu pen melhoi mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David in tua numei a kan dingin mi khat a sawl hi. “Tua nu, Eliam’ tanu, Hit mi Uriah’ zi Bathsheba hi, ci-in kigen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n David in kamtaite sawlin tua nu a hlansah hi. Ama kungah tua nu pei a, ama in tua nu a luppi hi. (Khum hun lai tahin tua nu a nin nei zaw a kisiensuo laitah ahi hi.) Tua ciengin a inn ah tua nu a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua numei a gai hi; tuale ama in mi sawlin David kungah, “Nau ka paai hi,” ci-in a gensah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n David in Joab kungah thu puoh a, “Hit mi Uriah ka kungah hing sawl in,” a ci hi. Tuale Joab in David kungah Uriah sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama kungah Uriah a tun ciengin David in Joab bangci op a, mite bang a ci vua, galdona bangci mavan ahei cite a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in Uriah kungah, “Na inn ah peisuh inlen na keng va sil ta’n,” a ci hi. Kumpipa’ inn panin Uriah pusuoh a, kumpipa tung panin letsong khat in ama a nuazui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin a pupa’ nasem zosie tawh kumpipa’ kotpi gei-ah Uriah lumin a inn ah peisuh lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in David kungah, “Uriah a inn ah peisuh lo hi,” ci-in a gen ciengun David in Uriah kungah, “Khuolzin hing tung na hi sih amah? Bang dingin na inn ah peisuh lo na hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Uriah in David kungah, “Buhte sungah singkuong, Israel, le Judah a om uhi; tuale ka pu Joab le ka pu’ nasemte lopang-ah gieh uhi; tua ziehin bang dingin anne tuidawn ding le ka zi tawh lumton dingin ka inn ah peisuh thei mawh ding ka hei?” a ci hi. Topa a hing ahi bang ma le nangma a hing na hi bang ma-in tam bangin ka gamta vawt sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in Uriah kungah, “Tuni zong tanah om phot inlen zing cieng kang peisah ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n khum ni-in zong Jerusalem-ah Uriah a taam hi. A zing ciengin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David in ama an le zu nehpi dingin ciel a, ama zu a khamsah hi; nitah lamin a pu’ nasemte tawh a lupna tunga lum dingin ama pusuoh a, hinanle a inn lamah a peisuh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zingmawng ciengin David in Joab lai khat hlah a, tua lai Uriah in a puosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A laihlah sungah, “Galhanna pen munah Uriah a madawhin pangsah inlen, ama kivatpua-in a si thei nadingin ama kung panin nangma nuakin in,” ci-in a giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Joab in khuopi a bulu laitahin mihat galhangte om hi, ci-a a theina munah Uriah a pangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khuo sung mite kuonin Joab tawh a kido uhi; tuale mite lahah David’ nasemte kimkhat a si hi. Hit mi Uriah zong kithat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joab in mi sawlin gal kidona thu zosie David kungah a gen hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tuale ama in kamtaipa thuhil a, “Gal kidona thu zosie kumpipa kungah na gen zaw ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />kumpipa lungthahin ama in na kungah, ‘Bang dinga khuopi lam nai senga galdo dinga va kuon ta na hi uh ahei? Kulpi bang tung panin ei kap va uh ci na thei sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jerubbaal’ tapa Abimelech koi in that ahei? Numei khat in kul tung panin ama tungah an-gawina suongpeh a tungta lam a khiehsuh ziehin Thebez ah ama si hi lo amah? Bang zieha kulpi lam nai-a pei na hi uh ahei?’ ang ci leh, ‘Na nasempa Hit mi Uriah zong si hi,’ na ci ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n kamtaipa pei-in a tung a, Joab in a gen dinga a sawl thu zosie David kungah a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kamtaipa in David kungah, “Mite in ei thazaw-in gamlahah ei do dingin ang kuon uhi; hinanle kote in zong tunkot lutna-ah amate ka notkia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin kul panin thalkap siemte in na nasemte ei na kap uhi; kumpipa’ nasem pawlkhat si-in Hit mi na nasem Uriah zong a si hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />David in kamtaipa kungah, “Joab kungah tam bangin na gen ding hi, ‘Tami thu ziehin kilungkhamsah sin, bangzieh ahei cile tu-in namsau in mi khatzaw cienga khat a vat ngai ma hi lel hi; na khuopi sim hanciemin lumlet in,’ ci-in Joab hantawh in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Uriah’ zi in a pasal si a zah bepin a pasal ziehin da-in a kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kaa le mau teng a ven zaw ciengin David in mi sawlin ama hlansah a, ama David’ zi suohin ama tawh tapa khat a nei hi. Hinanle David’ gamtatna tungah Topa a lungkim sih a,
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />tuale Topa in David kungah Nathan a sawl hi. Ama pei-in a kungah, “Khuopi khat sungah mi ni om a, khat hau-in a khat zawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihaupa in tuuhon le bawnghon tampi nei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ahi vangin a zawngpa in a leisa tuuno a nu khat losie bangma a nei sih hi. Ama in tua tuuno anva a, ama le a tate tawh a khangton hi; tua tuuno in ama’ an ne-in a hai panin dawn a, a kang sungah lumin ama adingin a tanu khat tawh a kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khatvei, mihaupa’ inn ah zin khat tung a, tuale ama in ama kunga tung zinpa neh dingin a tuuhon pan hile a bawnghon pan hile khat zong a gaw nuom sih a, mizawngpa’ neisun a tuuno lahpiehin ama kunga tung zinpa a gaw zawsop hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin tua mipa tungah David a sinso mama hi. Ama in Nathan kungah, “ Topa a hing ahi ma bangin tam banga a gamta mipa a si dingin kilawm hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ama in hepina nei loin tam bangin gamta ahi ziehin tua tuuno a za li-in a sangkia ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nathan in David kungah, “Tua mipa khu nang na hi hi! Israel Pasien, Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Keima in Israel tungah kumpi-in nang sathau kang nu a, Saul’ khut sung panin kang hunkhie hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />keima in na pu’ inn kang pie a, na pu’ zite na kang sungah a om hi. Israel innkuon le Judah innkuon zong nangma kang pie hi; tuale tam teng a tawm luo ahile tua sangin a tamzaw kang piehbe lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama muna-ah a sie gamta dingin bang dingin Topa thugen simmaw na hei? Namsau tawh Hit mi Uriah satlia-in na zi dingin ama’ zi na la a, Ammon-te’ namsau-in ama na that zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang in kei ei thusim loin na zi dingin Hit mi Uriah’ zi la zo na hi ziehin namsau in na inn a lawi ngai sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Keima in na innkuon sung panin nangma langah buoina ka piengsah ding hi; tuale na muna-ah na zite la-in na vengpa ka pie ding a, tuale ama in suntang laipi-in na zite a luppi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile nang in na dapbawl ahi hi; ahi vangin keima in Israel zosie mai-ah suntang laipi-in ka bawl ding hi,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David in Nathan kungah, “ Topa tungah ka maw zo hi,” a ci hi. Nathan in David kungah, “Tu-in Topa in na mawna la sieng zo hi; nang na si sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanle tam bang gamtatna tawh Topa thusim lo na hi ziehin na sung pana ang pieng ding nausen si ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin a inn ah Nathan a pei hi. Uriah’ zi in David tawh a nei nausen pen Topa in vatin nahpi-in a ci a na pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin nausen adingin Pasien kungah David in a thum hi; David in zong an tangin tuolpuongah a zan lup hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama pangah ama’ innsung upate a ding vua, tuolpuong panin a thawto nadingin ama a zawl uhi; ahi vangin ama thoto nuom loin amate tawh zong an ne nuom lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ni sagi ni-in tua nausen a si hi. Tua nausen a si lam David’ nasemte in David a ko ngam sih uhi; azieh pen amate in, “Ama in nausen hinlai bawnin i hopi vangin i thugen ngai nuom lo hi; tua ahile ama kungah nausen si ta ci’n bang i ci gen thei ding ahei? Ama le ama ang kibawlsie kha thei ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanle a nasemte’ kidap ho David in a mu ciengin nausen si hi, ci-in a thei ta hi; tuale David in a nasemte kungah, “Nausen a si ta amah?” a ci hi. Tuale amate in zong, “Ama si ta,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin tuolpuong lah panin David tho-in kisil a, sathau kinu-in a puonte a khel hi. Topa’ inn sungah ama tumin Pasien bie hi; tua ciengin a inn ah ama a pei hi; tuale ama in an a nget ciengin amate in a mai-ah an a lui vua, tuale ama in a ne hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin a nasemte in ama kungah, “Tam banga na gamtat a bang bep ahei? Nausen a hin lai-in an tangin na kap hi; ahi vangin nausen a si bepin tho-in an na ne zawsop hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in, “Nausen a hin lai-in an tangin ka kap hi; azieh pen keima in, ‘Nausen a hin nadingin Topa in ei lungsiet khah ding koi in thei ahei?’ ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hizongle tu-in ama si ta zuh a; bang dinga ken an ka tan tha ding ahei? Ama ka hingsah theikia ding amah? Ama kungah kei ka pei ding a, ahi vangin kei kungah ama ang kinuale ta sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in a zi Bathsheba hlai a, a kungah pei-in a luppi hi; tuale ama in tapa khat nei a, tuale ama in a min Solomon hisah hi. Topa in ama it a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />tuale kamsang Nathan tungtawnin thu a puoh hi; tuaci’n ama in Topa ziehin a min Jedidiah a phuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tu-in Joab in Ammon-te’ Rabbah simin kumpi khuopi a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Joab in David kungah kamtaite sawlin, “Rabbah ka sim zo hi; tua banah a khuopi tuikhuh zong ka la zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin tu-in mi a omlai teng khawmtuo inlen, khuopi langah phuol satin khuopi la in; tua ahi sihle kei mama in tua khuopi ka la ding a, keima’ min a puo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuaci’n David in mi zosie kaikhawmin Rabbah ah pei a, tua khuopi simin a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama in Milcom lu tung panin a kumpi lukhu a lahpieh hi; tua lukhu kham talen khat gih a, a sungah suong manpha khat a om hi; tuale David’ kumpi lukhu tungah tua suong manpha kikoi hi. Ama in khuopi sunga van kinuasie tampitah zong a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama in a sunga om mite peipi-in sing-at ding, tuzumte le sia heite tawh na sem dingin koi a, tehlei khenna-ah amate na a semsah hi. Tua bangin ama in Ammon-te’ khuopi zosie tungah a bawl hi. Tua ciengin David le mi zosie Jerusalem ah a kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hun phabeppi khat ang tawp hi. David’ tapa Absalom in sanggam numei a melhoi mama khat nei a, a min Tamar kici hi; tuale David’ tapa Amnon in tua nu a deigaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amnon in a sanggamnu Tamar a dei seng ziehin a natlaw vawt hi. Bangzieh ahei cile ama pen ngahnu siengtho ahi ziehin Amnon in ama bangma law thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin Amnon in David’ sanggampa Shimeah’ tapa Jonadab kici guolpa khat nei hi; ama pen mi khel mama khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in Amnon kungah, “Kumpipa tapa aw, bang dinga zingmawng khat zaw zingmawng khat hici gawn semsem mawh na hei? Ei gen lo ding na mah?” a ci hi. Amnon in ama kungah, “Ka sanggampa Absalom’ nau nu Tamar deigaw ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jonadab in ama kungah, “Na lupna tungah lum inlen a cina kipang in; tuale ang ve dinga na pa ang pei ciengin ama kungah, ‘Keima in mu-in ama’ khut panin an ka neh thei nadingin Tamar hing pei-in ka neh ding bangkhat ei bawlpieh heh,’ ci in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n Amnon lumin a cina a kipang hi; tuale a ve dingin kumpipa a pei ciengin Amnon in kumpipa kungah, “Ama’ khut panin an ka neh thei nadingin ka nau nu Tamar hing pei-in ka muna-ah moh pheng ni haw khat nang bawlsah nadingin kang thum hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in inn-a Tamar kungah mi sawl a, “Na sanggampa Amnon’ inn ah va haw ta’nlen a neh ding an va bawlpieh ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n a sanggampa Amnon lupna inn ah Tamar a va haw ta hi. Tua nu in annel lom la-in meh a, ama muna-ah mophengte bawlin tua mohte a em hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in khangbel la-in a mai-ah a thuapieh vangin ama in a ne nuom sih hi. Amnon in, “Ka kung panin mi zosie pusuohsah in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama kung panin mi zosie a pusuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Amnon in Tamar kungah, “Na khut panin an ka neh thei nadingin inndan sungah an hing tawi in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Tamar in a bawlsa mophengte la-in inndan sung ama’ sanggampa Amnon kungah tuate a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanle a neh dingin tuate ama kungah a tawi ciengin, ama in tua nu pummatin ama kungah, “Hing pei inlen kei ei luppi in, ka sanggamnu aw,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua nu in dawng a, “Hi lo hi, sanggampa aw, ei paubawl sin; azieh pen Israel sungah tam bangin kigamta ngai lo hi; tam bangin gitlo gamtat vawt sin!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hei sungah ka mai laa ngam nawn ding ka hei? Nang zong Israel sungah mi ginalo khat na hi ta ding hi. Tua ahi ziehin tu-in kang thum hi, kumpipa kungah gen in; bang ding ahei cile ama in nang tawh kei ei khaam lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in tua nu thugen a ngai sih hi; tuale ama nu sangin a hatzawh ziehin ama in hatthawthu tawh buonin a luppi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Amnon in Tamar a nah huot mama hi; a cil-a ama nu a lunggulna sangin a huotna a lienzaw ta vanuh hi. Amnon in tua nu kungah, “Pei dawh ta’n!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanle tua nu in ama kungah, “Hi lo hi, ka sanggampa aw; azieh pen kei tunga nei bawlsa khielna sangin kei nei sawldawhna lienzaw hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in a nasem tangvalpa hlanin, “Ka kung panin tami numei notmang inlen, ama nua-ah kot kalh in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />(Tua nu in puontuolpi a ban nei khat a sil hi; azieh pen kumpipa’ tanu ngahnu siengthote nidang lai-in tua banga na kivon uh ahi hi.) Tuaci’n a nasempa in a pulamah tua nu notdawhin kot a kalh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin Tamar in a lu tungah vut buohin ama’ sil puontuolpi bansau botkeh hi; ama nu in a lu tungah a khut koi-in a peikawmin a gingin kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A sanggampa Absalom in ama kungah, “Na sanggampa Amnon in ang luppi ta amah? Tu-in dai in, sanggamnu aw; ama na sanggampa ahi hi; tam thu na lungsimah koi da ta’n,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Tamar pen a sanggampa Absalom’ inn ah numei lungzuong khatin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kumpi David in tam thu teng zosie a zah ciengin lungthah mama a, ahi vangin ama pen a tacil ahi a, ama a it ziehin a tapa Amnon dan a pie sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin Absalom in Amnon kungah a pha hile a sie hile bangma gen vet lo hi; azieh pen ama in a sanggamnu Tamar a buon ziehin Absalom in Amnon a muda hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kum ni bih a cin zaw ciangin Absalom in Ephraim gei-a Baal-hazor ah tuumul heu pawi bawl a, Absalom in kumpipa’ tapate zosie hlan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kumpipa kungah Absalom pei a, “Na nasempa in tuumul heute ka nei hi; nei hepina-in kumpipa le a nasemte, na nasempa tawh nang pei zo ding vuoi mah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin kumpipa in Absalom kungah, “Hi sih, ka tapa aw, ka unpi-un ei peisah sin; hing pei uleng zong nang adingin vangih ka suoh ding uhi,” a ci hi. Ama in paugen a, ahi vangin ama pei nuom loin ama thupha a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin Absalom in, “Tua bang ahi thei vawt sih ding leh ka sanggampa Amnon beh tawh ei zawhsah in, hing thum ing,” a ci hi. Kumpipa in ama kungah, “Ama bang dinga nang tawh hing pei ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahi vangin Absalom in ama tawh Amnon le kumpipa’ tapa zosie a zawsah masangsie ha genin a gen hi. Absalom in kumpipa’ pawi tawh a kibang pawi khat a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin Absalom in a nasemte thu pie a, “Amnon’ zu lungnop hun khu melci unlen, keima in na kung vuah, ‘Amnon sat un,’ kang ci ciengin ama that un. Zau sih un; kei mama-in thu hing pie zo hi lo ka mah? Kihangsah unlen, hangsan un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuaci’n Absalom thupiehsa bangin a nasemte in Amnon a bawl uhi. Tua ciengin kumpipa’ tapa zosie dingin a laa tung ciet vuah tuongin a tai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amate lamkal a gei laitahun David kungah thu tung a, “Absalom in kumpipa’ tapate that sieng ta, koima khat beh kihen nawn sih,” kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kumpipa dingin a puonte botkeh a, tuol sena’n a kinei pai hi; tuale ama kunga a ding a nasem zosie in a puon a botkeh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahi vangin David’ sanggampa Shimeah’ tapa Jonadab in, “Kumpipa’ tapa zosie that sieng ta uhi, ci-in ka pu in ngaisun sin; Amnon khat maimai si ahi bo hi. Amnon in a nau nu Tamar a pumbuon ni-a patin Absalom in tam thu a na vaihawmsa ahi ta bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ziehin tu-in kumpipa’ tapa zosie si sieng ta hi, ci-in ka pu in tam thu na lungsim sungah koi sin; azieh pen Amnon khat maimai si ahi bo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahi vangin Absalom a taimang hi. Galvil tangvalpa a khuodah leh muolpang Horonaim lampi panin mi tampi a pei mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Jonadab in kumpipa kungah, “En in, kumpipa’ tapate ang pei ta uhi; na nasemte gen bangin pieng tahpi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A thugen a man zaw lienin kumpipa’ tapate tungin awngin a kap uhi; tuale Kumpipa le a nasem zosie zong nahpitahin a kap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ahi vangin Absalom taimang a, Geshur kumpipa Ammihud’ tapa Talmai kungah a pei hi. A tapa ziehin David ni khat zaw ni khat a kapkap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Geshur ah Absalom tai a, khum sungah kum thum sung a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kumpipa’ lungtang sungah Absalom kunga haw ding a hlagul hi; azieh pen tu-in Amnon sina tung tangah ama a kihlai zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Absalom tungah kumpipa’ lungsim a om lamtah Zeruiah’ tapa Joab in a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Joab in Tekoa ah mi sawlin khum mun panin numei pil khat zawpi hi. Ama in tua numei kungah, “A kap kipang in; dana puonte sil in, sathau kinu sinlen, ni tampi sung si-uop numeite bangin om in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpipa kungah pei inlen ama kungah tam bangin gen in,” a ci hi. Tuale Joab in tua nu tungah a thugen dingte a mop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa kungah Tekoa numei a tun ciengin a mai tuolah kunin zatahna a pie hi. Ama in, “Ei hu in, Kumpipa aw!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpipa in tua nu kungah, “Na lungkhamna bang ahei?” a ci hi. Tua nu in dawng a, “Kadei, kei pen meigong numei khat ka hi hi; ka pasal lah si zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na nasem nu in tapa ni nei a, lolai-ah ama gel a kihau uhi; a phel ding koima om loin khat in a khat pa satin a that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu-in a innkuon buppi-un na nasem nu’ langkhatah a ding uhi. Amate in, ‘Ama in a tha a sanggampa’ hinna tangin ama ka tha thei nadingun a sanggampa a satpua pa ei pie in, gamhluo pa nangawn zong ka susie ding uhi,’ ei ci uhi. Amate in a omlai ka kinepna pa tua bangin ei suhsietpieh vua, leitungah ka pasal’ min le a suonlehlah themkhat zong a om lo dingin ei bawl uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in tua nu kungah, “Na inn ah pei in, keima in nang tungtang thu ka pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tekoa numei in kumpipa kungah, “Ka pu kumpipa aw, kei tung le ka innkuon tungah mawna tu hinlen, kumpipa le a mangtona mawpeng taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Na kungah mi khatpo in thu khatpo ang gen leh ka kungah tua mipa hing peipi in. Ama in nang ang thamkia ngai nawn sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in, “Sisan phulapa in that nawn loin ka tapa a kisuhsiet lo nadingin hepina tawh kumpipa in na lungsim sungah Topa na Pasien hing phawh bo in,” a ci hi. Ama in, “ Topa a hing ahi ma bangin na tapa’ samzam khat zong tuolah kie lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin numei nu in, “Hepina tawh na nasem nu in ka pu kumpipa tungah kam khat ei gensah in,” a ci hi. Ama in, “Gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Numei nu in, “Tua ahile Pasien’ mite langkhatah bang dinga tam bang na bawl sawm ahei? Bang ding ahei cile tam bang khensatna a piehna-ah kumpipa in a gamdel mipa inn ah na hlatkia masangsie, kumpipa ama le ama a kimawsah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eite i unpi-in i si ding hi; eite pen tuola kibuo a kiluoh thei lo tui tawh kibang i hi uhi. Ahi vangin Pasien in hinna khat pen a mawh lah sih hi; ama in a opna pana a kipuse mi khat a khantana a kihawlkhiet lo nadingin ama in lampi gelpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu-in ka pu kunga tam thu gen dinga ang pei ka hi hi, azieh pen mite in kei ei zausah hi; na nasem nu in, ‘Kumpipa kungah thu ka gen ding hi; kumpipa in a nasem nu’ ngetna ang sem kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile kumpipa in za-in, Pasien’ gouluo panin kei le ka tapa ei sumangton ding mipa’ khut sung panin a nasem nu a hunkhie ding hi,’ ci-in a ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na nasem nu in, ‘Ka pu kumpipa’ kammal in ei toidamsah ding hi,’ ci-in ngaisun hi; bangzieh ahei cile ka pu kumpipa pen a sie le a pha khentel thei Pasien’ vantungmi tawh kibang hi. Nang tawh Topa na Pasien hing omton taheh!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in numei nu dawng a, “Kang dawh popo ei pha sin,” a ci hi. Numei nu in, “Ka pu kumpipa in gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Tam thu zosie Joab’ hing thupieh ahiei mah?” a ci hi. Numei nu in dawng a, “Ka pu kumpipa aw! nang a hing tahtah na hi ma bangin, ka pu kumpipa in na gensa thute panin koima zietlam hile veilam hile a piel thei sih hi. Bangzieh ahei cile kei ei sawlpa pen na nasem pa Joab ahi hi; na nasem nu’ kam sunga tam thu ei mop pa zong khu ama ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na thu peizie na khel nadinga na nasempa Joab in tam thu a bawl ahi hi. Ahi vangin ka pu in leitunga om na vannuoi theithei nadingin Pasien’ vantungmi’ pilna tawh a kibang pilna na nei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in Joab kungah, “Hoi mama hi, tam kang pie hi; va pei inlen tangval Absalom hing zawpikia in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuolah Joab khupbawhin zatahna pie a, kumpipa thupha a pie hi; tuale Joab in, “Kumpipa in a nasempa ngetna pie zo ta ahi ziehin tuni-in ka pu kumpipa mai-ah maipha ka nga zo hi, ci thu na nasempa in ka thei ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaci’n Joab kuon pai a, Geshur ah pei-in ama in Jerusalem ah Absalom a zawpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Ama a inn ah peisah in; ka opna-ah ama ang pei sih ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n a inn ah Absalom pei-in kumpipa opna-ah pei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu-in Israel zosie sungah a melhoina ziehin Absalom banga phattah ding koima om lo hi; a ketaw panin a luzang dong ama tungah muhkaw ding bangma om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in a luzang sam a heu ciengin (bangzieh ahei cile kum tawp sielin ama in a sam a heu let hi; a sam a gih seng ciengin a heu hi), a luzang sam tawi a te a, kumpipa’ tawikhaina-ah a te ciengin shekel zani gih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Absalom sung panin tapa thum, le Tamar kici ta numei khat a pieng hi; tua nu pen numei melhoi khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpipa’ opna-ah pei loin Jerusalem ah kum ni tangcim Absalom a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ciengin Absalom in kumpipa kungah ama zawpi dingin Joab hlan ding mi a sawl hi; ahi vangin ama kungah Joab pei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a nasemte kungah, “En un, Joab’ logam, kei-a’ tawh kizon lien ahi hi. Khumtahah ama in mangbuham nei hi; pei unlen mei tawh vahal ta un,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Absalom’ nasemte in tua logam mei tawh a hal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joab dingin a inn-a om Absalom kungah haw a, “Na nasemte in bang dinga ka logam ei halpieh uh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Absalom in Joab dawng a, “En in, nang kam kang vaihlah hi: Kumpipa kungah nang hing sawlin, “Bang dinga Geshur pana hing pei ka hei? Khum munah om lai leng kei adingin hoi zaw ngel ding hiven,” a cisah dingin tam sungah hing pei ta’n ang ci ka hi hi. Tu-in kei kumpipa opna-ah ei peisah inlen, mawna ka nei tah leh zong ama in ei that taheh!’ ka ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joab in kumpipa kunga a gen ciengin ama in Absalom hlan dingin mi sawl pai hi. Tuaci’n kumpipa kungah ama haw a, kumpipa mai-ah khupbawhin a mai tuolah a kun hi; tuale kumpipa in Absalom a nam hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam zaw ciengin Absalom in sakol leeng khat le a sakolte, le a mai-a tai ding mi sawmnga a kithawisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Absalom thobai-in kul kotpi lam gei-ah ding zel hi; tuale mi khatpo in thu nei-in kumpipa mai-ah a tut ciengin Absalom in hlan zelin, “Koi khuo pan na hiei?” a ci hi. Mipa in, “Na nasempa, Israel sunga tua minam tua khuote ka hi hi,” a ci ciengin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Absalom in, “En in, na thunei pen hoi a, zong a dih hi; ahi vangin kumpipa in na thu ang zahpi ding mi koima ngansie a nei sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Absalom in a genbe lai a, “Gam sunga thukhen khat hi leng maw! Tua ciengin mi tawh kiheh, ahi sihle thunei zosie ka kungah hing pei va-un, ke’n zong a thu uh a tangin khenpieh ma ding hi veng,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama tungah zatahna pie dingin mi khat in ama kung nai-in a pei sielin a khut zahin tupomin a nam zel let hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua bangin Absalom in kumpi kunga thukhensah dinga ang pei Israel-te tungah a gamta hi; tuaci’n Absalom in Israel mite’ lungsim a guhpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kum li a cin ciengin Absalom in kumpipa kungah, “Hebron ah ei peisah inlen, Topa kungah ka ciemsa ka thuciem ei bawlsah in, ci-in kang thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Azieh pen Aram-a Geshur ah ka op laitahin na nasempa in thuciem khat ka na bawl hi: Jerusalem ah Topa in ei peipikia tahtaha ahile Hebron ah Topa ka bie ding hi, ka ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kumpipa in ama kungah, “Lungmuong tahin pei in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n tho-in Hebron-ah ama a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin Absalom in Israel minam zosie kungah kamtaite sawldapin, “Note in pengkul gin na zah behun tam bangin awng un: Hebron ah Absalom kumpi suoh zo hi!’ ci-un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jerusalem panin Absalom tawh mi za ni a pei uhi; amate ahile a kiciel zinte ahi vua, lungsim hoi tawh pei-in bangma thu a thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Absalom in biehpiehna a pieh laitahin a khuopi Gilon panin David’ thu kuppipa Gilon-te Ahitophel a hlansah hi. Sawmdapna thahat semsem a, Absalom nuazui mi a khang tehteh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />David kungah kamtai khat tung a, “Absalom lamah Israel-te’ lungtang pei sieng zo hi,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in Jerusalem-a ama tawh a omton ama’ ulien zosie kungah, “Tho un! Tai vai, tua hi sihle Absalom kung panin i suotah nading uh om lo ding hi. Manlang un, tua hi sihle ama in ei pha pai ding hi, ama in i tung vuah gimna ang tungsah ding a, namsau tawh khuopi ang sim ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpipa’ uliente in kumpipa kungah, “Ka pu kumpipa in na khensat popo sem dingin na nasemte a baisa ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpipa pei-in inn ngaih dinga a nuasie a mei numei sawmte simlo a innkuon zosie in ama’ nua a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpipa pei-in mi zosie in ama’ nua a zui uhi; tuale inn tawpna pen khatah amate a khawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama’ ulien zosie in ama a makhel uhi; tuale Chereth-te zosie, Peleth-te zosie, le Gath pana ama ang zui Gitt-te mi za guhte zosie, kumpipa’ mai nawhin pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin Gitt-te Ittai kungah, “Nang in zong bang dinga nei zui ahiei? Nuakia inlen kumpipa tawh omton in; bangzieh ahei cile nang gamdang mi na hi a, na gam pana ang kinotmang na hi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zani ahiei khat a ang tung pan hi bo cin a, kei na ngawn in zong nang hei lam zuon ding ci kang thei lo laitahin tuni-in kote tawh a vah kawikawi dingin kang pui ding amah? Na sanggamte zawpi inlen peikia ta’n; tuale Topa in nang tungah a itna kip le a thumanna hing lah taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hinanle Ittai in kumpipa dawng a, “ Topa hing a, ka pu kumpipa zong a hing ahi ma bangin, ka pu kumpipa opna popo-ah si leng hing leng na nasempa kang pei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />David in Ittai kungah, “Tua ahile pei in, peisuoh in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Gitt-te Ittai, a mite zosie le a zawpi numei naupang zosie tawh a peisuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi zosie a pei laitahin gam sung mi zosie a gingin a kap uhi; kumpipa in Kidron Lui galkai-in mi zosie in senel gam lam a manaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Abiathar a peito a, tuale Zadok zong Levi-te zosie tawh pei-in Pasien’ thuciemna singkuong a puo uhi. Mite in khuopi a kal zaw masangsie amate in Pasien’ thuciemna singkuong a nga phot tadi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in Zadok kungah, “Khuopi sungah Pasien’ singkuong puokia in. Topa’ maipha ka mu leh ama in kei ei puohkia ding a, tuami le a opna mun ei musahkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in, ‘Nang tungah lungkim sing,’ ei ci leh tanah kei ka om hi, ama in hoi a sah bangin kei tungah bawl taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpipa in zong siempu Zadok kungah, “En in, nuom tahin nangma le Abiathar, na tapa nite Ahimaaz le Abiathar’ tapa Jonathan tawh khuopi sungah peikia ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />En un, kei thu ei puoh dingin nangma kung panin thu ang tun masang senel gam sunga tanmunte-ah kang na ngah ding hi,” cibe lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jerusalem-ah Zadok le Abiathar in Pasien’ singkuong a puokia vua, tua munah ama gel a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahi vangin Olive Muoltung katona lam zuonin a pei pumin David kap a, puon kilukhu-in a keng guohin lam a pei hi; a zawpi mi zosie puon kilukhusa-in a peito pumun a kap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />David kungah, A sawmsim mite lahah Ahithophel zong Absalom tawh kipawl hi,” ci-in kigen hi. David in, “ Topa aw, kang thum hi. Ahithophel’ thumopte motna-in na heipieh in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Pasien biehna muol vumah David a tun ciengin a dawn dingin a puontungsil balkehsa le a lu tungah leivui bangsa-in Archi mi Hushai a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />David in ama kungah, “Kei nei zui suoh leh kei adingin vangih na hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahi vangin khuopi sungah peikia-in Absalom kungah, ‘Kumpipa aw; masang lai-a na pa’ nasem ka hi ma bangin tu-in zong nangma’ nasem ka hi ding hi,’ ci-in va gen ta’n, tua hile keima dingin Ahithophel’ thumopte na sumit thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Khum munah nang tawh siempu Zadok le Abiathar ang om ding uhi. Tuaci’n kumpipa’ inn sunga na thu zah poma Zadok le Abiathar siempu tegel kungah gen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Khum munah amau’ tapa gel, Zadok’ tapa Ahimaaz le Abiathar’ tapa Jonathan, tawh a omton uhi; tuale ama gel tungtawnin na thuzah zosie kei nei theisah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jerusalem ah Absalom a lut laitahin David’ guolpa Hushai zong khuopi sungah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David in muolvum a hlen zep tahin Mephibosheth’ nasempa Ziba in anlum zani, lengga a kiphogawsa bawh zakhat, khal theiga zakhat le lenggazu savun thawldim khat a puo, a phaw kivawsa laa ni tawh ama na lamdot hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kumpipa in Ziba kungah, “Tamte bang dinga nei puoh ahei?” a ci hi. Ziba in dawng a, “Laate kumpipa’ innkuonte tuon nading, anlum le khal theigate tangvalte neh ding, le lenggazu pen senel gama a basamte dawn ding ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Tua ahile na pu’ tapa hei sunga om ahiei?” a ci hi. Ziba in kumpipa kungah, “Ama Jeruaslem-ah om hi. Bang ding ahei cile ama in, ‘Tuni-in Israel innkuon in ka pu’ kumpi gam keima ei piekia ding hi,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in Ziba kungah, “Mephibosheth’ neisa zosie tu-in nang-a’ ahi ta hi,” a ci hi. Ziba in, “Keima in nang zatahna kang pie hi; ka pu kumpipa’ muna-ah maipha ei musah ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bahurim-ah Kumpi David a tun ciengin ama a samsie dingin Saul’ innkuon sunga a innsung mi, Gera’ tapa Shimei kici pa khat a pei hi; a samsiet kawmin ama a peikhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in Kumpi David le a nasemte zosie suong tawh sep hi; tua laitahin mi zosie le galhang zosie a ziet a vei-ah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Shimei in a samsiet kawmin, “Peimang! Peimang! Tuol thatpa! Mi ginalo Pa!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama tanga na uh Saul innkuonte’ sisan luongsah na hi ziehin Topa in nang tungah ang thuh zo hi; tuale Topa in na tapa Absalom tungah na kumpi gam a pie zo hi. En in, gimna in ang nuaphah zo hi; bangzieh ahei cile nang sisan luongsah mipa na hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Zeruiah’ tapa Abishai in kumpipa kungah, “Tami uisi tawh a kibang lel khat in bang dinga ka pu kumpipa hici samsiet viel ding ahei? Ei kuonsah inlen a lu ei tansah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin kumpipa in, “No Zeruiah’ tapate aw, kei le no bang kisai i hei? Topa in ama kungah, ‘David va samsie tan,’ a ci zieha ei samsiet ahile koi in, ‘Bang dinga na tuaci bawl ahei?’ ci thei ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />David in Abishai le a nasem zosie kungah, “Keima’ tapa bawn in tha dingin ei sui zuh a; tu-in tam Benjamin mipa in bangza-in ei suizaw kan lai ding ahei! Ama’ thu-in omsah unlen ei samsiesah lel un; bangzieh ahei cile Topa in ama a sawl zong hi thei kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in ka gentheina ei ensuhin tuni-in tam banga ei kisamsietna ziehin Topa in a hoi tawh kei ei thuh kha ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n lampi-ah David le a mite a pei vua, ama tawh kigalsai muolpangah Shimei a pei laitahin, ama in a pei kawmin ama samsie-in suong tawh sepin leivui a the hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kumpipa le a zawpi mi zosie lamba-in Jordan ah a tung uhi; tuale khum munah ama kitoidamsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tu-in Jerusalem ah Absalom le Israel-te zosie a tung uhi; Ahithophel zong ama tawh a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Absalom kungah David’ guolpa, Archi mi Hushai a tun ciengin Hushai in Absalom kungah, “Kumpipa damsawt heh! Kumpipa dam sawt heh!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Absalom in Hushai kungah, “Tam khu na guolpa tunga na thumanna pen amah? Bang dinga na guolpa tawh zawh lo na hiei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hushai in Absalom kungah, “Hi lo hi; Topa le tam mite le Israel-te zosie in a teelsa uh mipa-a’ ka hi ding a, ama tawh ka om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua banah a koi pen’ na sem ding ka hei? Ama’ tapa hi lo ding amah? Na pa’ na ka sep bang lienin nangma’ na zong ka sem ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Absalom in Ahithophel kungah, “Thu ei kuppi in; bang bawl ding i hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahithophel in Absalom kungah, “Na pa in inn ngah dinga a nuasie a meite va luppi ta’n; tua hile na pa’ huot thei dinga nang le nang na kibawl lam Israel zosie in za-in tuaci’n nang tawh ang om mi zosie’ khutte ang thakhau tuom ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in zong innkhum zangah Absalom adingin puonbuh khat a lam uhi; Israel zosie’ mitmu-in Absalom in a pa’ meite a luppi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khum hun lai-in Ahithophel’ thumopte Pasien’ thuphuon bangin kingaisun hi; tuaci’n David le Absalom in Ahithophel’ thumopte zosie thupi sim tuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua tham loin Ahithophel in Absalom kungah, “Mi tul sawmle tulni ei teelsah in, keima kuonin tuzanin David va nuadel ta vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama a gim le a lungkieh petin keima in va simin ka va zausisah ding hi; tua hile ama panpi zosie a taimang sieng ding uhi. Keima in kumpipa ngentang ka that ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuale motha nu in a pasal kung a zot bangin na kungah mi zosie kang zawpikia ding hi. Nang pen mi khat lien beh tha ding a sui na hi a, midang zosie lungnuomin om ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ngaisutna in Absalom le Israel upa zosie a lungkimsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Absalom in, “Archi mi Hushai zong va hlan ta un. Ama’ thugen ngai phot vai,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Absalom kungah Hushai a tun ciengin Absalom in, “Ahithophel’ thugen tam teng dan ahi hi; ama’ genna banga i man ding uh amah? Ahi sihle nang in gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin Hushai in Absalom kungah, “Tu tunga Ahithophel’ ang thumop a hoi sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hushai in a genban zom a, “Na pa le a mite galhang behbeh ahi vua, gam sunga a note a kilahpieh vompi bangin a hangsan lam uh na thei hi. Tua banah na pa galbawl kiva mama khat ahi hi; galkapte tawh zanin ama a giehton sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu nangawnin ama dum khat sungah ahiei, ahi sihle mundang khatah ahiei kiphuol zo ta kha ding hi. I galkapte uh pawlkhat kido cilna-ah si uleh tua thu a za poma in, ‘Absalom nuazui galkapte lahah mi a si tam mama hi,’ ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin humpi lungtang a kuo galhangpa nangawn cieng zau-in lungkie ding hi; azieh pen na pa galhang ahi a, ama panpi zosie zong galhat ngentang a hina thu Israel zosie in a thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin kei ang thumop nop pen ahile Dan panin Beer-sheba dong, tuipi gei-a senel za-a a tam Israel mi zosie na kungah khawm inlen, nang mama gal sim dingin kuon in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n tu-in eite in zong i mumuna vuah amate i sim ding vua, amate tungah tuol a daitui kie bangin i kie ding uhi; ama hile ama panpite hile khat beh suohta lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khuopi sunga a nuakia leh Israel zosie in tua khuo sungah khauhuol tawi-in suongpem khat nangawn a kimu lo dongin kuom sungah tua khuopi i kaimang ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Absalom le Israel mi zosie in, “Ahithophel’ thumop sangin Archi mi Hushai’ thumop hoizaw hi,” a ci uhi. Bang ding ahei cile Topa in Absalom tungah sietna a tunsah thei nadingin Ahithophel’ thumop khu a guolel mawng dinga Topa’ sesa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Hushai in siempu Zadok le Abiathar kungah, “Tua bang tua bangin Ahithophel in Absalom le Israel upate kungah thu a mop hi; tuale keima in zong tua bang tua bangin thu ka mop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin mallangin mi sawl gel inlen David kungah, “Tu zanin senel gam tanmunte-ah na gieh sinlen, ahi thei bang bangin na galkai zaw in; tua hi sihle kumpipa le a zawpi zosie ang kivaltum ding hi,’ ci-in gensah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Enrogel ah Jonathan le Ahimaaz in a ngah uhi; nasem numei khat va pei zelin ama gel kungah thu gen a, ama gel in zong kumpi David kungah tua thu a gensawn zel uhi; bangzieh ahei cile khuopi sungah mite’ mu-in ama gel lut ngam lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi vangin naupang khat in ama gel mu-in Absalom kungah a sawm hi; tuaci’n a ni gelin a nawtai pai vua, a inn huong sunga tuikhuh nei Bahurim-a mi khat kungah tungin tua tuikhuh sungah a kumsuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua mipa’ zi in tuikhuh kamsin khat la-in tuikhuh kam tungah pha a, tua tungah an a pho hi; tua thu koima’n a thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Numei nu’ inn ah Absalom’ nasemte a tun ciengun, “Ahimaaz le Jonathan hei ta uh ahei?” a ci uhi. Tua numei nu in amate kungah, “Ama gel luigal a kai zo ta uhi,” a ci hi. Amate in a sui kawikawi vua, a mu zo lo bepun Jerusalem-ah a kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate a peizaw ciengun tuikhuh panin ama gel a kato vua, kumpi David kungah a gen ding teng va pei-in a gen uhi. Ama gel in David kungah, “Pei inlen luigal kai ta naw’n; azieh pen tua bang tua bangin nangma langkhatah Ahithophel in thumop hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n David le a zawpi mipi zosie kisa pai-in Jordan gun a galkai uhi; khuo a vah ciengin Jordan galkai lo mi koima om nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahitophel in a thumop a kizui lo lam a thei ciengin a laa phaw pha a, tuaci’n a khuo-a inn ah a pei hi. Ama in a inn sung vaiteng hawmin a gui-awh hi; ama si-in a pa’ hanah kivui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel mite zosie tawh Absalom Jordan a galkai laitahun Mahanaim ah David a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu-in Absalom in galkapte tunga a uh dingin Joab’ munah Amasa koi hi. Amasa pen Joab’ nu Zeruiah’ naunu Nahash’ tanu Abigail tawh kinung Ishmael mi Ithra kici mipa khat’ tapa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel-te le Absalom in Gilead gamah giephuol sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mahanaim ah David a tun ciengin Ammon-te’ gam Rabbah panin Nahash’ tapa Shobi, le Lo-debar panin Ammiel’ tapa Machir, le Rogelim panin Gilead mi Barzillai in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />lupnate, kisilna kuongte, le leibeelte, mangbu, mangbuham, an, ankan, bepi le besante,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />khuoizu le bawngnawi-thaukhalte, tuu le sathaukhalte zong David le a zawpite neh dingin a puo uhi; bangzieh ahei cile amate in, “Senel gamah galkapte gilkielin gimin dangta uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in a zawpi a mite khawmin a tultul a uhte le a zaza a uhte-in a koi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale David in a galkapte se thum a suo a, sekhat Joab’ uhna nei-ah, sekhat Joab’ sanggampa Zeruiah’ tapa Abishai’ uhna nei-ah, sekhat Gitt mi Ittai’ uhna nei-ah koi hi. Kumpipa in mite kungah, “Kei mama zong no tawh kang kuon ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin mite in, “Nang, nang kuon sih ding hi. Azieh pen kote tai uleng amate in khawh ei sa lo ding hi. Mi alang khat si nan uleng zong khawh ei sa tuom lo ding uhi. Ahi vangin kote mi tulsawm za-in nang na manpha hi; tua ahi ziehin ei hu ding khuopi panin mi hing sawl lacin hoizaw hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa in amate kungah, “No hoisah pen bangin kang bawl na ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n gal sim dingin galkapte zosie a tultul a zaza-in a kihonzawt laitahun kul tunkot pangah kumpipa a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpipa in Joab, Abishai, le Ittai-te kungah, “Keima nei khuolna-un tangvalpa Absalom hing dawm bo vuo izaw,” a ci hi. Mi zosie in Absalom tawh kisai-a kumpipa in galkapmang zosie tunga a thupiehte a za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n gamlahah Israel do dingin galkapte a kuon uhi; tuale Ephraim gammang tulahah a kido uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khum munah David’ nasemte in Israel mite a zo vua, khum ni-in mi kithat a tam mama a, a si mi tul sawmni pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gam sung muncin tengah gal kidona kizel hi; tuale khum ni-in namsau’ tha sangin gamlahah a si mi tamzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Absalom in David’ nasemte tuoh kha khelkhel hi. Absalom a laa tungah tuong a, gangpi sing golpi a ba pha mama nei khatah a laa tai-in gangpi ba lahah a lutang awh a, a laa taisuohin vanlelei kikalah a kikhaisa-in ama a kinuasie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi khat in mu a, Joab kungah, “Gangpi singba kawmah Absalom a kikhailawng ka mu hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Joab in ama kunga thugen pa kungah, “Bang e na gen, ama na mu i! Tua ahile bang dinga khumnah ama satlia-in tuoldenna nang nei pai lo ahiei? Ngun peh sawm le kawnggah khat beh hing pie ngel ma ding hi veng,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua mipa in Joab kungah, “Ka khut sungah ngun shekel tulkhat nangawn ei kipie le zong kumpipa’ tapa tha nadingin ka khut ka hlang sih ding hi; azieh pen kote zahin kumpipa in nang, Abishai, le Ittai tam bangin thu ang vaihlah hi: Keima nei khuolna-un tangvalpa Absalom hing dawm bo un!’ ang ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thu dang khatah kei zuoutatin ama’ hinna that mawh leng, (kumpipa tungah bangma phuolsel om lo hi), nang mama kikangkoi-in nei hum tuom sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Joab in, “Tam bangin nang tawh hun mawh tawpsah sih vang,” ci-in ama in teipi thum la-in gangpi singba kawmah a hinglai-in Absalom’ lungtang sontah sun pailet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuale Joab’ galhiem a puo tangval sawm in Absalom imtawmin a satlia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joab in zong pengkul tum a, Israel-te a delna panun galkapte a kilekia uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile Joab in galkapte a khaam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in Absalom luonghawm a la vua, gamlaha dum golpi khat sungah ama pai-in ama tungah suongcien gol mama khat a ciengto uhi. Khum laitahin Israel-te zosie a inn ciet vuah a taimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Absalom in ama’ khan sungin kumpipa’ kuomah khuompi khat la-in ama adingin phut hi, azieh pen ama in, “Keima’ min a kiphaw nading tapa ka nei sih hi,” a ci hi; ama in tua khuompi pen ama’ min tap a, tuni cieng dongin Absalom’ Muolsuong kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin Zadok’ tapa Ahimaaz in, “Keima ei taisah inlen, Topa in a galte’ vanglietna panin ama hunkhie zo hi, ci-in kumpipa kungah thu ei puohsah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Joab in ama kungah, “Tuni-in nang in lungdamna thu na puoh thei sih ding hi; nidang khat ciengin thu na puoh thei pan beh ding a, ahi vangin tuni-in tua bang na bawl thei sih ding hi, azieh pen kumpipa’ tapa si zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joab in Cush mipa kungah, “Pei inlen na sil musa teng kumpipa kungah va gen in,” a ci hi. Cush mipa zong Joab mai-ah kunin a tai pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin Zadok’ tapa Ahimaaz in Joab kungah, “Bangbang hi leh Cush mipa’ nua-ah ei taisah in,” cikia hi. Joab in, “Lungdamna thu puohna ziehin thaman nga tuom ngap lo ding, bang dinga tai sawm na hei, ka tapa aw?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in, “A suoh nuom suoh, kei zong ka va tai ta ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama in, “Tai in,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin zanglei lam zuonin Ahimaaz a tai a, Cush mipa a makhel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua laitahin kul kotpi a sungta pen le a puta pen kikalah David a to hi. Galvil pa kulkotpi khumzang a pang panin kato-in a dahto leh ama guoha ang tai mi khat a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Galvil pa awngin kumpipa kungah gen hi. Kumpipa in, “Ama guoh ahile lungdamna thu hing tut ahi hi,” a ci hi. Ama nawtai-in a neh semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Galvil pa in mituom a tai khat mukia hi; galvil pa in kot cingpa hlanin ama kungah, “En in, mituom khat ama guohin ang taikia ta!” a ci hi. Kumpipa in, “Ama zong lungdamna thu ang puoh ma ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ciengin galvil pa in, “Pasal ang tai masa pa Zadok’ tapa Ahimaaz’ taidan tawh kisun sa veng aw,” a ci hi. Kumpipa in, “Ama mihoi ahi a, lungdamna thuhoi tawh ang tung ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa kungah Ahimaaz kiko a, “Na zosie hoi hi!” a ci hi. Tua ciengin kumpipa mai-ah a mai kunin tuolah khupbawh a, “ Ka pu kumpipa’ langkhatah a khuttum a ziel mite nangma khut sunga ang pie Topa na Pasien in thupha nga taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Tangval Absalom a dam nai mah?” a ci hi. Ahimaaz in dawng a, “Joab in na nasempa ei sawl laitahin buoina lienpi khat ka mu a, ahi vangin bang ahei ci ka thei sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kumpipa in, “Kihei inlen tanah ding in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama kihei-in pia lo-in a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ciengin Cush mipa a tung hi; tuale Cush mipa in, “Ka pu kumpipa adingin lungdamna thu ahi hi! Azieh pen tuni-in Topa in na dihna a talang zo ta a, nangma langkhatah a ding mi zosie’ vanglietna panin ang hun zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kumpipa in Cush mipa kungah, “Tangvalpa Absalom a dam nai mah?” a ci hi. Cush mipa in dawng a, “Ka pu kumpipa’ galte, le na siet nadinga na langa dingte zosie tua tangvalpa bang taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kumpipa’ lungsim nahpi-in sukha a, tunkot tunga inndanah a kato pumin a kap hi; tuale ama in, “Aw ka tapa Absalom, ka tapa, ka tapa Absalom! Nang si tangin kei sizaw ve leng izaw. Aw Absalom, ka tapa, ka tapa!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joab kungah, “Absalom ziehin kumpipa kap le mau-in om hi,” ci-in kigen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n khum ni-a galzawna pen galkap zosie adingin dana le kaana a suoh ta hi; azieh pen khum ni-in galkapte in, “Kumpipa a tapa ziehin a da mama hi,” ci-in thu za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Galtaite maizumin a daptun vakhuan bangun khum ni-in khuopi sungah galkapte a daplut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa in a mai khu-in nahpi tahin kap a, ‘Aw ka tapa Absalom, Aw Absalom, ka tapa, ka tapa!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa’ inn sungah Joab tum a, ama in, “Tuni-in nangma’ hinna, na tanu na tapate’ hinna, na zite le na meite’ hinna ang hunkhie na galkap ulien zosie na maizumsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile nang ang mudate na it a, nang ang itte na muda zawsop hi. Nang adingin galkapmangte le galkap uliente bangma ahi lo lamtah tuni-in na sulang zo ta hi; azieh pen Absalom hing hinlen, kote zosie tuni-in si sieng uleng na nop zawh ding ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n tu mama-in va pei tanlen na nasemte kamdam no tawh va hopi in; azieh pen na pei sih poma leh tuzan ciengin mi khat zong nang kungah om nawn lo ding hi, ci-in Topa’ minin ka kiciem ngam hi. Tuale tam thu pen na tangval-a kipan tu cieng dong na tunga ang tungsa gimna khat popo sangin nang adingin ang siehuoi zaw ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa dingin kultunkot gei-ah a to hi. Galkapte kungah, “En un, kultunkotah kumpipa a to hi,” ci-in kigen sieng hi; tuale kumpipa mai-ah galkap zosie a pei uhi. Khum hun laitahin Israel-te zosie a inn ciet vuah a taimang sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel minam zosie sungah mi zosie a kisel vua, tuale amate in, “Kumpipa in i galte khut sung panin ei hlakhie a, Philistia-te khut sung panin ei hunkhie hi; tuale tu-in Absalom ziehin gam sung panin ama taimang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin eite tungah kumpi dingin sathau i nupa uh lah gal sungah si zo hi. Tua ahi ziehin tu-in bang dinga kumpipa nua zawpikia nading bangma na gen lo uh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpi David in siempu Zadok le Abiathar tungah tam thu puoh a, “Judah upate kungah tam bangin gen un: Kumpipa a inna peipi nukhia pen ding na hi uh amah?’ ci un. Kumpipa kungah Israel mi zosie’ thugen tung zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Note ka tanau na hi vua, note ka tel ka vo na hi uhi; bang dinga kumpipa peipi nukhia pen hi ding na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuale Amasa kungah, “Nang ka tel ka vo hi lo na mah? Tuaci’n tu-a patin nang Joab’ tanga ka galkapmangpa na hi sih tah leh Pasien in kei ei dop bawl sih taheh” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amasa’ thugen in Judah mi zosie’ lungsim hawisahin a kithukhatsah pai a, amate in zong kumpipa kungah thu puohin, “Nangma le na nasemte zosie hing kilekia ta un,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jordan ah kumpipa kilekia hi; tuale kumpipa dawn ding le Jordan gal kaipi dingin Gilgal ah Judah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumpi David dawn dingin Benjamin-te Gera’ tapa Shimei zong Judah mite tawh mallangin a peisuh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />ama tawh Benjamin mi tulkhat a om hi. Tuale Saul’ innsung nasem Ziba, a tapa sawm le nga le a nasem sawmni tawh a zawh vua, kumpipa’ mai Jordan ah nawtai suhin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />kumpipa’ innkuonte a galkaipi ding le ama dei banga na sem dingin tanmun ah amate a galkai uhi. Jordan a galkai kuon ding ciengin kumpipa mai-ah Gera’ tapa Shimei bawhsuh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />kumpipa kungah, “Ka pu kumpipa in Jerusalem na nuasie ni-a na nasempa in na tunga kang bawl khielna ka pu in ei mawsah loin ei ciemte sin; Kumpipa in ngaisutin ei nei sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile na nasempa in ka maw lam ka thei hi; tua ahi ziehin, en in, ka pu kumpipa dawn dinga ang kuonsuh Joseph’ innkuon zosie sung panin tuni-in ang tung masa pen ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zeruiah’ tapa Abishai in a dawng a, “Shimei in Topa’ sathau nupa a samsiet ziehin ama tha pai ding hi lo amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin David in, “No Zeruiah’ tapate aw, tuni-in kei ei langpang dinga bang hing kikumthaw na hi uh ahei? Israel gam sungah tuni-in mi khatpo kithat ding amah? Bangzieh ahei cile tuni-in Israel-te’ kumpipa ka hi lam thei buong sam hi lo ka mah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kumpipa in Shimei kungah, “Nang na si sih ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuale kumpipa in ama tungah kiciemna a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kumpipa dawn dingin Saul’ tupa Meiphibosheth a peisuh hi; Kumpipa a pei ni-a kipanin dam le bihin a tunkia ni dongin ama in a keng sil lo, a khamul heu loin a puon zong sawp lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kumpipa tawh kimu dingin Jerusalem a tun ciengin kumpipa in, “Mephibosheth, bang dinga kei nei zui lo ahiei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in dawng a, “Ka pu, kumpipa aw, ka nasempa in kei ei sol hi; azieh pen na nasempa in a kungah, ‘A tungah tuongin kumpipa tawh ka zaw thei nadingin kei dingin ka laa-phaw va guong tan,’ ka ci hi. Azieh pen na nasempa a khelbai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in ka pu kumpipa kungah na nasempa ei mindaisah zo hi. Hinanle ka pu kumpipa pen Pasien’ vantungmi tawh a kibang hi; tua ahi ziehin hoi na sah bangin ei bawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Azieh pen ka pu kumpipa mai-ah ka pa’ innkuon zosie si ding beh ngaha om ahi bo uhi. Hinanle nang in na sabuoi-a an a ne mite lahah kei nei koi hi. Tua ahi ciengin kumpipa kungah bang hamphatna kang ngen kan nawn ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kumpipa in ama kungah, “Bang dinga na kungtung thu na hici gengen ahei? Ka khensatsa ahi hi: Nangma le Ziba in leitang na hawm ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mephibosheth in kumpipa kungah, “Ka pu kumpipa dam le bihin inn nang tun buongin ama a unpi-in lasah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Rogelim panin Gilead-te Barzillai a peisuh hi; Jordan gal khatah a cing dingin kumpipa tawh ama a peisuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Barzillai pen a khangham mama mi khat ahi a, kum sawmgiet a pha hi. Mahanaim ah kumpipa a op laitahin ama in an le tui na sih zing hi, azieh pen ama mihau mama khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kumpipa in Barzillai kungah, “Jerusalem-a ka kungah ei zui in, keima’n nang va vang,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahi vangin Barzillai in kumpipa kungah, “Kumpipa tawh Jerusalem-a kang peito na valia dingin kei kum bangza hing lai ding ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuni-in kum sawmgiet ka cing ta hi; a nuom le a nuom lo zong ka khen thei tha ding amah? Na nasempa in ka neh ka dawnte zong a tui lam ka thei nawn beh ding amah? Lasa numei le pasalte’ awging zong ka za thei nawn beh ding amah? Tua ahi ciengin bang dinga na nasempa, ka pu kumpipa vangih kibelap na bep dinga hing om ding ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na nasempa in Jordan tuipi gal khatah bakhat sung ang zui ding hi. Bang dinga kumpipa in khum bang thaman ei pieh son ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka nu le ka pa’ han gei-a keima’ khuo sunga ka si thei nadingin na nasempa hepina tawh ei kilesah kia ta’n. Hinanle tanah na nasempa Chimham om hi; ka pu kumpipa tawh ama zawhton heh; tuale nangma’ hoisah popo ama adingin bawlpieh in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kumpipa in dawng a, “Chimham tawh ka zawh ding a, nang hoisah bangin ama ading ka bawlpieh ding hi; tuale kei tung pana na dei vannuoi nang adingin kang bawlpieh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua ciengin mi zosie in Jordan galkai-in kumpipa zong a galkai hi; kumpipa in Barzillai namin thupha pie a, tuale a inn ah ama a kilekia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Gilgal dongah kumpipa a peisuoh hi; tuale Chimham zong ama tawh a zawh hi; Judah mi zosie le Israel mi alang in zong a pei nading lampi-ah kumpipa a hla uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tua ciengin Israel mi zosie in pei-in kumpipa kungah, “Bang dinga ka sanggam uh Judah mite in nangma hing gumangin, kumpipa le a innkuonte, le David’ mi zosie ama tawh, Jordan galah zawpi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Judah mi zosie in Israel mite dawngin, “Kumpipa pen ko tawh a kinai tanau ka hi zieh uh ahi hi. Tuale tam thu-ah bang dinga lungthah na hi uh ahei? Kumpipa’ sum tawh anne tuidawn ka hi son uh amah? Ahi sihle ama in kote letsong khatpo ei pie amah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ahi vangin Israel mite in Judah mite dawngkia-in, “Kumpipa sungah tanh sawm ka nei vua, David’ sungah zong no sangin tam ka neizaw uhi. Tuale note in bang dinga nei ci nuoisie uh ahei? I kumpipa nua lahkia dinga thugen masa koma ka hi sih uh amah? Ahi vangin Israel mite’ thugen sangin Judah mite thugen a bunzaw hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Benjamin mi, Bichri’ tapa Sheba a kici mi ginalo khat khum sungah na om kha hi. Ama in pengkul mutin, “David sungah tanh i nei sih a, Jessi’ tapa sungah gamh i nei sih hi! Israel aw, mi zosie na puonbuh vuah pei un!” ci-in a kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n Israel mi zosie in David a nuasie vua, Bichri’ tapa Sheba a zui uhi; ahi vangin Judah mite in Jordan panin Jerusalem cieng dong a kumpipa uh kiptahin a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jerusalem-a a inn ah David a tung hi; tuale kumpipa in a inn ngah dinga a nuasie a mei sawmte khawmin inn khatah amate cingsahin an le tui a pie hi, ahi vangin ama in amate a luppi nawn sih hi. Tuaci’n a si dongun inn sungah amate kikhumcipin meigong numei bangin hinkhuo a mang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa in Amasa kungah, “Ni thum sungin Judah mi zosie ka kungah hing khawm inlen, nang mama zong tanah hing om in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n Judah hlan dingin Amasa a kuon hi; ahi vangin a kiniciem hunin ama tung loin a kiheh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David in Abishai kungah, “Tu-in Bichri’ tapa Sheba in Absalom sangin ei bawlsie zaw ding hi; na pu’ nasemte zawpi inlen ama va nuadel ta’n, tua ahi sihle ama’n ama adingin kul tawh ki-im khuopite mu-in eite kung panin a pitmang ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abishai’ nua-ah Joab le Chereth-te, Peleth-te, le mi thahat zosie kuon uhi; Bichri’ tapa Sheba nuadel dingin Jerusalem panin amate a kuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gibeon-a suongpi opna mun a phah tahun, amate tawh kimu dingin Amasa a pei hi. Tu-in Joab in galkap puon sil a, tua tungah a pai-a kisiet namsau khat kivaw kawnggah khat a kawngah a gah hi; ama a mai-ah a pei phei leh tua namsau tuolah kie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Joab in Amasa kungah, “Ka sanggampa, na dam nai mah?” a ci hi. Tuale Joab in ama nam dingin a zietlam khutin a khamulah Amasa a man hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin Amasa in Joab’ khut sungah namsau a op lam a phawh kha sih hi; Joab in a gilpi dawtpiehin a sungkuo teng tuolah luongkhe-in ama a si hi. Tua ciengin Joab le a sanggampa Abishai in Bichri’ tapa Sheba a nuadel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuale Amasa gei-ah Joab’ mite khat dingin ama in, “Joab panpi poma, le David-a’ ahi poma in Joab nua zui un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lam lienpi tunga ama’ sisan sungah Amasa kidie-in a om hi. Tuale lamlienpi-a pei mi zosie in ama a mu ciengun a dinkhawl uhi. Ama kunga a pei mi zosie a khawl lam a mu ziehin ama in lamlienpi panin gamlahah Amasa’ luong puo-in ama puon khat a se hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lamlienpi panin ama’ luong a kihep sieng bepin Bechri’ tapa Sheba del dingin Joab’ nua-ah mi zosie a peisuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sheba in Beth-maacah gam Abel dong Israel minam zosie a nawhsuoh hi; tuale Bichri’ mi zosie kikhawmin ama’ nua zui-in a sungah a tum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Joab’ galkapte pei-in Beth-maacah gam Abel ah ama a kui-im uhi; amate in khuopi tawh kimaingatin kulpi mai-ah leicien a bawl uhi. Joab’ galkapte in kulpi a cipzan thei nadingin a susie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin numei pilvang khat in khuopi panin hlanin, “Ngai un! Ngai un! Joab kungah gen un, ‘Tam tahah hing pei in, nangma kungah thu kang gen nuom hi,’ ci-un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua numei nu gei-ah ama pei a, tua nu in, “Joab kici nang na mah?” a ci hi. Ama in dawng a, “Hi na’ng,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin ama in, “Na nasemnu’ thugente ei ngaipieh in,” a ci hi. Ama in dawngin, “Kang ngaipieh hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama nu in, “Khanglui lai-in mite in, ‘Abel ah thu dongsah un,’ a ci thei zel uhi; tuaci’n amate in thukhenna na bawl zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kei pen Israel sungah kilemna a dei le a muontah mi khat ka hi hi; nang in Israel sungah nu tawh a kibang khuopi khat suhsiet na sawm hi; bang dingin Topa’ gouluo valtum ding na hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Joab in dawng a, “Valtum ding hile suhsiet ding hile bawl vawt sih vang!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua khu thuman ahi sih hi! Ahi vangin Ephraim muoltung gam mi Bichri’ tapa Sheba a kicipa khat in kumpi David do nading a khut a hlang hi; ama beh ei pie in, tua hile khuopi panin ka pei ding hi,” a ci hi. Numei nu in Joab kungah, “Kulpi panglam na kungah a lutang ang kisepsuh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin numei nu in a pilna zangin khuopi sunga mi zosie kungah a pei hi. Tuale Bichri’ tapa Sheba’ lu tansanin Joab sena-in a nei uhi. Tuaci’n ama in pengkul mut a, Joab in Jerusalem-a kumpipa kung a zot lai tahin, khuopi panin amate kithezahin a inn ciet a zuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu-in Joab in Israel galkap zosie makai hi; Jehoiada’ tapa Benaiah in Chereth-te le Peleth-te a makai hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Adoram pen thona-aana nasemte uhpa ahi hi; Ahilud’ tapa Jehoshaphat pen thuciemte pa ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sheva pen thuvanpi pa ahi hi; Zadok le Abiathar pen siempute ahi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tuale Jair mi Ira zong David’ siempu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in kum khat zaw kum khat, David’ khan sungin kum thum sung kielpi a tung hi; tuale David in Topa kungah thu dong hi. Topa in, “Ama in Gibeon-te a tha ziehin Saul le a innkuon tungah sisan luonsahna zieha khielna a om hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpipa in Gibeon-te hlanin amate a hopi hi. (Tu-in Gibeon-te pen Israel mite ahi sih vua, Armor mi a omlaite ahi uhi. Amate hinkhawi dingin Israel mite kiciem zo napi Israel mite le Judah mite ading a deisah luotna-in Saul in amate thagam ding na hanciem hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David in Gibeon-te kungah, “Note dingin bang kang bawlpieh diei? Topa’ gouluo thupha na pieh thei nadingun bangci danin kilemna kang bawl thei diei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gibeon-te in ama kungah, “Kote le Saul ahi sihle a innkuon tawh kikal thu pen ngun le kham tawh a mai thei ding ahi sih hi; Israel sunga mi khatpo ka tha zieh vua zong lungkim zawh nading a om sih hi. Ama in, “Note ading kang bawlpieh ding bang hi, na ci uh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in kumpipa kungah, “Israel gam sung teng zosie-ah mun ka nei lo nadingun kote ei thatgamin ei suhsiet sawm mipa-
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />kote tungah a tapa sagite ei piesah inlen, kote in zong Topa’ muoltunga om Gibeon-a Topa mai-ah amate ka khailia ding uhi,” a ci uhi. Kumpipa in, “Amate kang pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin kumpipa in David le Saul’ tapa Jonathan kikala om Topa tawh kiciemna ziehin Saul’ tupa, Jonathan’ tapa Mephibosheth a hinkhawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa in Aiah’ tanu Rizpah’ tapa ni, Saul tawh a nei Armoni le Mephibosheth; le Saul’ tanu Merab in Meholah mi Barzillai’ tapa Adriel tawh a nei a tapa ngate a la hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ama in Gibeon-te tungah tua teng pie a, amate in Topa mai muol tungah a khailia uhi. Amate a sagi-in a siton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Aiah’ tanu Rizpah in la-ip puon la-in, anlah huna kipan guotui kieh dongin suong khat tungah ama adingin pha a, tua misi luongte tungah sunlai-in vana leng vate hile zanlai-in gamsate hile a tusah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />David kungah Saul’ meinu Aiah’ tanu Rizpah’ bawl dante a kigen ciengin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />David pei-in Gilboa muol tungah Philistia-te in Saul a tha lai vua Philistia-te in amate a khailupna mun Bethshan-a mipi kikhopna panin amate a guhpieh Jabesh-gilead mite tung panin Saul’ gute le a tapa Jonathan’ gute a lakia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in khum mun panin Saul le a tapa Jonathan’ gute a puoto hi; tuale amate in a kikhailum mite’ gute zong a khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zela khuo Benjamin’ leitang, a pa Kish’ han sungah Saul le a tapa Jonathan’ gute a phum vua, kumpipa’ thupieh zosie a sem uhi. Tua zaw ciengin Pasien in khum gam adinga thumnate a sang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel tawh Philistia-te a kidokia vua, ama’ nasemte tawh David a kuonsuh hi. Amate in Philistia-te a sim vua, David a gim mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Migolte suonlehlahte khat, a teipi sumngo shekel zathum a gih, galhiem a tha khat a kuo Ishbi-benob in David ka that ding hi, a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hizongle ama hum dingin Zeruiah’ tapa Abishai pei a, Philistia mipa simin that hi. Tua ciengin ama tungah David’ mite kiciemin, “Israel’ meivah na suhmit lo nadingin ko tawh galdo dingin nang kuon nawn sih ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tam zaw ciengin Gob ah Philistia-te tawh gal kidona omkia hi; tua ciengin Hushath mi Sibbecai in migolte’ suonlehlahte khat ahi Saph that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin Gob ah Philistia-te tawh galkidona adang khat om leuleu hi; Bethlehem-te Jaare-oregim’ tapa Elhanan in a teibul siamgante’ siemlawng cie bang a pha, Gitt-te Goliath that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A khutphang langkhat tuohah khutme guh, a kephang langkhat tuohah keme guh, a unpi-in sawmni le li a nei migol khat a opna mun ahi Gath ah gal om leuleu hi; ama zong migolte’ suonlehlahte khat ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in Israel a tawh ciengin David’ sanggampa Shimei’ tapa Jonathan in ama that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tam mi li teng Gath-a migolte’ suonlehlahte ahi uhi; David le a nasemte’ khutlum tawh amate a si uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in a galte zosie’ khut sung le Saul’ khut sung panin ama a hutkhiet ni-in David in tam latengte Topa kungah na sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in a gen hi: “ Topa khu ka suongpi, ka kulpi, kei ei hunkhie pa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ka Pasien, ka kibuhna ka suongpi, ka lum le ka hutdamna saki, ka mun muonhuoi le ka belh, ka hundam pa ahi hi.; nangma in a tatsie mite panin kei nei hundam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A phat tah Topa ka hlan a, ka galte khut sung panin kei ei kihundam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile sina tuihuolte in kei ei imtawm a, manthaina tuikhangte in keima ei nawh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Misikhuo khauhuolte in kei ei kantawm a, sina thangte in kei ei dawntuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka genthei hunin keima in Topa’ kungah ka thum hi; ka Pasien kungah keima ka tau hi. A biehinn panin ama in ka aw za a, ama in ka kikona a bil ei ngat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama’ lungthah ziehin leitung kithingin, nahpi-in kilawh gawp a, vantung dopphate kiling gawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama’ nahkuo panin meikhu a pusuoh a, ama’ kam sung panin mi katum thei mei a pusuoh hi; ama tung panin mei-am a kuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in vantungte kunsahin a kumsuh vua; ama’ keng nei-ah khuomu tawkhalpi om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cherub khat tungah ama tuongin leng a; hui’ hlate tungah ama kimu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in a kimvelah khuomiel a siem a, a tungkhu dingin tui kikhawmtuo meii sapi zang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama’ mai-a a taang sung panin mei-amte a kuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Van panin keh kie bangin Topa awngsuh a; Sangpen Pa in ama’ aw a gingsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in thaltangte kapin tuate thethang a, ama in tun phesahin amahaw a delmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa’ phawsiet zieh le ama’ nahkuo panin a naahu a hla ziehin, tuipi tawdopte kimu a, leitung bulpite kidawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mun sang panin ei banin ei kai a, tui hatpi lah panin ei kaikhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thahat ka galte kung pan le ei mudate kung panin kei ei hunkhie hi; azieh pen amate a thahat mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka tuosiet ni-in kei ei bulu vua, ahi vangin Topa khu ka kingapna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in mun tanzau ah kei ei zawpi a; ka tungah a lungkim ziehin ama in kei ei hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka dihna tawh kizui-in Topa in thaman ei pie a; ka khutte a sienthona tawh kizui-in ama in kei ei dinkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa’ lampite ka zui zo ta a, keima in gitlo bawlin ka Pasien ka taisan sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama’ ngaina kip zosie, ka mai-ah a op ziehin, ama’ thukhamte panin kei ka piel sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama mai-ah kaw ka baang sih a, khielna panin ka kikoicing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in keima’ thumanna zui le ama muna-ah ka sienthona zui-in kei ei dinkia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thuman mi tungah thumanna na lah a; kawbaang lo mi tungah kawbaan lona na lah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A siengtho mi tungah na sienthona na lah a, a lungkawi mite tungah na letatna na lah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nang in mi neilutte na hunkhie a, hinanle a kiliensah mite na niemkhieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A tahtahin Topa aw, nang ka meivah na hi a, Topa in keima’ khuomiel a vahsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nang ziehin galkap honkhat ka sumaimang a, Ka Pasien ziehin khuokul khat ka kan zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tam Pasien a lampi bukim a; Topa’ kamciem a tangtung hi; ama a bel zosie adingin kidalna lum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa simlo Pasien koi ahei? I Pasien simlo, suongpi koi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pasien in keima thahatna ei guon a, ka lampi ei gol honpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama in keima’ kephangte sazuhpi kephang bangsah a, a sangna munah ei ding kipsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ama in galsim nadingin ka khutte ei cil a, tuaci’n ka bante in sumngo thal a kuoi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Na hundamna lum kei nei pie zo ta a, nangma’ ei panpina in kei nei liensah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Suohta tahin kal nei suonsah a, ka kitawnkhaw sih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />ka galte delin ka susiemang a, amate a manthai masangun kei ka kinuale sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A tho zo nawn lo dingin amate sumangin ka satpua a; ka kephang nei-ah amate puamat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Azieh pen nangma in galdo nadingin thahatna kawnggah tawh nei gah a; kei ei dote ka nei-ah na siel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Nangma in ka galte, kei ei mudate, na nuakiasah a, keima in amate ka susie gawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amate a khuodah vua, ahi vangin a hundam ding koima om lo hi; Topa kungah a kiko vua, hinanle ama in dawng lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Leivui bangin amate ka satvui a, lam lai-a buon nawi bangin amate ka tuonmat a, ka sianal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Kei ei langpang mite panin kei nei hunkhie a, minamte’ lutangin nei koi hi; ka theikhah lo mite in ka na a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Gamdang mite ka mai-ah kunin ka thugen a zah behun, ka thu a mang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Gamdang mite a lungkie vua, a mun muonhuoite panin citunin a peikhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Topa hing hi! Ka suongpi in thupha nga hinlen, ka Pasien, ka hundamna suongpi, kitawisang taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Phu ei lahpieh Pasien in mite ka keng nei-ah koisuh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />ka galte khut sung panin ei peipi a; ei langpangte tungah ei tawisang hi. Thagumhat mite khut sung panin ama in kei ei hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Topa aw, tam thu ziehin minamte lahah kang phat ding a, na minphatna la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Ama pen a kumpipa adingin hutdamna tausang ahi a, ama in a sathaunu pa David le a suonlehlahte tungah tangtawngin a itna kip a lah hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in tam teng khu David’ kam nukhiate ahi hi: Pasien in a tawisang mipa, Jacob’ Pasien in sathau a nu pa, Israel a thahat pa’ angvan pa, Jessi tapa David’ thuphuon tam bang ahi hi: Topa’ hlagau in kei tungtawnin thu gen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka kam sungah ama’ kammal a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel Pasien in thu gen zo a, Israel Suongpi in kei kungah tam bangin a gen hi: Mi khat in mite tungah thumanna tawh uhin Pasien zatahna tawh a uh ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tua khu zingmawng meii kai lo ni-a a suoh ni taang tawh kibang a, guo a zuh zaw ciengin lei lahah a po lopa dawngte tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka innkuon zong Pasien tawh tua bangma hi lo amah? Azieh pen ama in kei tawh tawntung thuciemna bawl zo a, na zosie a hoi a kipin a bawl hi. Ama in ka lunggulna le ei panpina zosie ang kibelapsah sih ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien thei lote ahi uleh a kipaimang ling kungte tawh kibang hi; bangzieh ahei cile khut guoh tawh amate kitham thei lo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tua bangte a tham ding poma in siatawn ahi sihle teizum zang a, amate mei tawh a kihaltum sieng hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tam teng David’ nei galhang mite’ min ahi hi: Josheb-basshebeth pen Tahchemon-te a hi hi; ama pen Thumte a uhpa ahi hi; ama in a teipi tawi-in mi zagiet thakhatin that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama zomah Ahohi’ tapa, Dodo’ tapa Eleazar pen galhang thumte lahah khat ahi hi. Khum munah galsim dinga kikhawm Philistia-te a phin lai-un David tawh ama a om hi. Israel-te a nuakia vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ahi vangin a dinna tuolah ama a ding den hi. A bante khamin a khut le a namsau a kimat dongin ama in Philistia-te a satlia hi. Topa in khum ni-in guolzawna lienpi tungsah hi. Tua ciengin ama kungah mite a kilekia vangun misite van khawm ding beh ahi bo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama zomah Harar mi Agee’ tapa Shammah ahi hi. Beli a dima a pona mun Lehi-a lozau-ah Philistia-te a kikhawm uhi; tuale Philistia-te kung panin galkapte a taimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hizongle ama lozau laikimah pangin tua lo hung a, Philistia-te that hi; tuale Topa in guolzawna lienpi a piengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Anlah kipat hunin Adullam leihawm-a om David kungah ama pawl dingin uhpi sawmthumte sung panin mi thumte a peisuh vua, tua hun laitahin Philistia-te honkhat in Rephaim kuomah giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin mun muonhuoi sungah David a om hi; tuale Bethlehem ah Philistia khuocingte a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />David in lunggulna tawh, “Mi khat in Bethlehem tunkot gei-a tuikhuh panin ka dawn ding tui ei saw leh nuom sam vang e!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua bepin galhang thumte in Philistia-te’ galphuol a phukeh vua, tunkot gei-a om Bethlehem tuikhuh panin tui tawi-in David kungah a peipi uhi. Ahi vangin ama in tua tui dawn lo hi; ama in Topa adingin tua tui a sung hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />azieh pen ama in, “ Topa aw, tami tui ka dawn vawt sih ding hi. A hinna uh khama a va peite’ sisan ken ka dawn thei ding amah?” a ci hi. Tua ahi ziehin ama in a dawn sih hi. Galhang thumte in tam bangin a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu-in Zeruiah’ tapa Joab’ sanggampa Abishai pen mi Sawmthumte a uhpa ahi hi. Ama in a teipi tawh mi zathum simin that a, ama in mi Thumte banah minthanna nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mihing Sawmthumte sung panin ama a mindawh pen ahi a, amau’ makai a suoh hi. Ahi vangin ama in tua mi Thumte ban zo lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kabzeel khuo panin Jehoiada’ tapa Benaiah zong a hang le galdo a siem, na golpi a sempa khat ahi hi; ama in Moab-te Ariel’ tapate ni a satlia hi. Vua kieh ni khatin ama zong peisuhin leihawm sunga om humpi khat that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in Egypt-te a melhoi khat that hi. Egypt-pa in a khutah teipi tawi hi; ahi vangin Benaiah in ciengkhut khat tawi-in ama kungah pei a, Egypt-pa’ khut sung panin a teipi lahpiehin ama’ teipi ma tawh ama that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jehoiada’ tapa Benaiah in tua bang teng na bawl a, galhang Thumte banah min na nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama pen mi Sawmthumte lahah a min kidawh a, ahi vangin ama in mi Thumte pha zo deu lo hi. David in ama pen ama cingte uhpa-in koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi Sawmthumte lahah Joab’ sanggampa Asahel; Bethlehem-te Dodo’ tapa Elhanan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Harod-te Shammah, Harod-te Elika;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Palti-te Helez; Tekoa-te Ikkesh’ tapa Ira;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Anathoth-te Abiezer; Hushath-te Mebunnai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahoh-te Zalmon; Netophah-te Maharai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Netophah-te Baanah’ tapa Heleb; Benjamin-te’ gam sunga om Gibeah-te Ribai’ tapa Ittai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pirathon-te Benaiah; Gaash gei-a kuom panin Hiddai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Arbath-te Abi-albon; Bahurim-te Azmaveth;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Shaalbon-te Eliahba; Jashen’ tapate: Jonathan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Harar-te Shammah’ tapa , Harar-te Sharar’ tapa Ahiam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Maacah-te Ahasbai’ tapa Eliphelet; Gilon-te Ahithophel’ tapa Eliam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Carmel-te Hezro, Arbi-te Paarai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Zobah-te Nathan’ tapa Igal; Gad-te Bani;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ammon-te Zelek; Beeroth-te Naharai; Zeruiah’ tapa galhiem a tawi Joab; Beeroth-te Naharai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ithri-te Ira, Ithri-te Gareb,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hitt-te Uriah; a unpi-in sawmthum le sagi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khatvei Israel tungah Topa a sinsokia a, amate langkhatah David hantawhin, “Pei inlen Israel le Judah mite va sim ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n kumpipa in Joab le ama tawh a omton galkapmangte kungah, “Mi bangza pha ahei ci ka thei nadingin Dan panin Beer-sheba dong Israel minam zosie lahah pei-in mi phaza va sim ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanle Joab in kumpipa kungah, “ Topa na Pasien in mi a za zakhatin pungsah hinlen, ka pu kumpipa’ mit in a mu thei lai dingin hing bawl taheh! Ahi vangin bang dinga ka pu kumpipa in tam thu na bawl nuom mawh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hizongle kumpipa thugen in Joab le galkapmangte a thuzaw hi. Tuaci’n Israel mi phaza a sim dingin kumpipa opna panin Joab le galkapmangte a dingkhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate Jordan galkai-in Aroer le kuom laikima om khuopi pan kipanin Gad lam manaw-in Jazer lamah a peisuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate Gilead-ah a tung vua, khum tah panin Hitt-te’ gam Kadesh a tung uhi; tuale khum panin amate Dan ah a tung vua, Dan panin kuol pei-in Sidon a tung uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuale Tyre kulpi, Hiv-te le Canaan-te’ khuopi zosie-ah a amate tung uhi; tuale khum panin Judah-te’ Negeb lam Beer-sheba ah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n a gam sung zosie a kuolva zaw uh, hla kuo le ni sawmni a cin zaw ciengin Jerusalem-ah a peikia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Joab in a kumpipa kungah a kisimsa mi phaza gawm a puoh hi: Israel sungah namsau tawi thei galkap tul zagiet om a, Judah sungah tul zanga a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin khum zaw ciengin ama in mi a sim zo tah ziehin David kisia mama hi. David in Topa kungah, “Ka silbawlsa tung tangah nahpi tahin ka maw hi. Ahi vangin tu-in, Topa aw, nang tungah kang thum hi. Na nasempa’ khielna ei ngaidam in. Azieh pen ka mot gamtat hai kha ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zingmawngin David a thaw ciengin David’ thumu pa kamsang Gad tungah Topa’ thu tung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Pei inlen David kungah tam bangin gen in: Topa in tam bangin a gen hi: Nang tungah thu thum kang pie hi. Khat penpen teel in, na tungah kang bawl ding hi,’ ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n David kungah Gad pei-in a gen hi. Ama in, “Kum thum sung na gamah kielpi ang tungzaw ding mah? Na galte in hla thum sung hing gamdelin a masang vuah taizaw ding na mah? Ahi sihle ni thum sung na gamah pul natna hing tungzaw ding amah? Tu-in ngaisun inlen ei sawlpa kungah bang dawnna puohkia ding ka hei khentat in,” ci-in dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin David in Gad kungah, “Ka lung a kham mama hi; ama’ ei hepina lien seng ahi ziehin mihing’ khut sungah ei tungsah sih hinlen, Topa’ khut sungah tungzaw vai,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa in zingmawng panin a kise hun cieng dongin Israel-te tungah pul natna a tungsah hi; tuale Dan panin Beer-sheba dongin mi tul sawm sagi a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jerusalem a susie dingin vantungmi in a khut a zah laitahin Topa in sil hoi lo bawl ding ki-awi loin mite lahah sietna bawlpa vantungmi kungah, “Pha zo ta; tu-in khawl ta’n,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin Jebus-te Araunah’ ancilna gei-ah Topa’ vantungmi a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David in mi susie vantungmi a mu bepin ama in Topa kungah, “A maw kei beh ka hi hi, a gitlo gamtat kei beh ka hi bo hi; tami tuute in bang a bawl uh ahei? Kang thum hi, keima le ka innkuonpite tung behah na khut hing hlang in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khum ni-in David kungah Gad pei-in, “Peito inlen Jebus-te Araunah’ ancilna-ah Topa dingin maitam khat va bawl ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa’ thupiehsa bangin Gad’ hilna bang zui-in David a peito hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Araunah in a ensuh leh kumpipa le a nasemte ama kung lam zuona ang peito a mu hi. Araunah zong a pusuoh hi; tuale David mai-ah tuolkunin a khupbawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Araunah in, “Ka pu kumpipa’ na nasempa kungah bang dinga hing haw na hei?” a ci hi. David in, “Mite tung panin pulnatna a ven thei nadingin na ancilna kilei hinlen tuami tungah Topa adingin maitam khat kilam leh ka ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin Araunah in David kungah, “Hoi na sah bangin ka pu kumpipa in la inlen biehna pie in; meihal biehna dingin bawngtangte le na meitaw nadingin ancilna peehte le bawng lokaina hahkol singte tanah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kumpipa aw, keima Araunah in tam teng zosie kumpipa tungah kang pie hi,” a ci hi. Tuale Araunah in kumpipa kungah, “Nangma tungah Topa na Pasien in hepi lungsiet tahin hing thuh taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi vangin kumpipa in Araunah kungah, “Hi lo hi, tamte pen nangma tung panin a man pie-a kang lei ding ahi bo hi. A man bangma pie loin Topa ka Pasien tungah meihal biehna ka pie sih ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n David in ngun shekel sawmnga tawh ancilna phuol le bawngtang tegel a lei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />David in khumnah Topa adingin maitam khat bawl a, meihal biehna le thunuoma biehna a pie hi. Tuaci’n Topa in khum gam ading thumnate dawng a, Israel sung panin pul natna a veng hi.
  </para>
</usx>
